translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_40dfb5cd:

    # e "Hey, General."
    e "嗨，将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_b21ba27b:

    # k "Courier? Had Chief given you the approval to enter the tribe?"
    k "信使？族长允许你进部落了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_118adec5:

    # e "Yes."
    e "是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_b4dba52f:

    # k "...so, another face I'll have to remember well."
    k "……看来又多了一张我得好好记住的面孔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_6cbcb53b:

    # e "Are you ok?"
    e "你的伤势怎么样了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_2d0406aa:

    # k "No, I told you to kill me right there, so I didn't have to suffer such a long week of resting."
    k "不，我当时就叫你直接杀了我，这样我就不用痛苦地熬过这么漫长的一周休养了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_43360f76:

    # e "Stop... I didn't mean any harm."
    e "别……我不是故意要伤害你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_35153737:

    # k "Whatever, I'm not arguing with you, I still have to recover somehow."
    k "随便吧，我不想跟你争，我总得想办法恢复过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_4723c323:

    # k "Thanks for saving Furkan anyway."
    k "不过还是谢谢你救了弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_ee60c608:

    # e "So, how are you doing."
    e "那么，你最近怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_f9a9c39c:

    # e "I remembered you had to carry Furkan back to the Tribe."
    e "我记得你还得把弗坎背回部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_2ec69d3c:

    # k "Well, I'll just say he's quite heavier than maybe 20 years ago."
    k "我只能说，他比大概二十年前重了不少。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_bf90dd40:

    # e "How did it go... after saving Furkan in the cave."
    e "把弗坎从洞里救出来之后，怎么样了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_c394473b:

    # k "It's fine."
    k "没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_17622bbc:

    # e "I mean, did anything happened between you two?"
    e "我是说，你们两个之间有没有发生什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_ddbc5ca2:

    # k "W-what?"
    k "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_df829dbc:

    # k "No?"
    k "没有？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_76067fa4:

    # e "Alright alright."
    e "好吧，好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_74e18e83:

    # k "But, I have to say."
    k "不过，我得说一句。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_2920f717:

    # k "Thanks for helping me save Furkan."
    k "谢谢你帮我救出弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_fab4eaf3:

    # e "No problem."
    e "不客气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_751b2954:

    # k "What's the meaning of this, courier."
    k "你这是什么意思，信使？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_50afd1d4:

    # e "Uhm..."
    e "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_b6e89eda:

    # k "You dare come up to me bare-skinned? How insolent."
    k "你竟敢赤身裸体地走到我面前？真是无礼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_af07a39f:

    # e "S-sorry."
    e "对、对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_79ebf5db:

    # k "Now, speak your words, the sooner we end this, the better."
    k "现在，说出你的来意。越早结束这件事越好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Normal_Talk_77aaa495:

    # k "Courier." nointeract
    k "信使。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Normal_Talk_29bfd31b:

    # e "Hey, Kari, I'm ready for the practice."
    e "嘿，卡里，我准备好训练了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Goat_Tribe_853e1c1c:

    # e "So, how's the tribe going?"
    e "那么，部落最近怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Goat_Tribe_b55f0994:

    # k "Good, I'm training a new troop currently."
    k "很好，我现在正在训练一支新队伍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Goat_Tribe_e2165fc5:

    # k "We have to reduce the number of mages. So, we're training in tradional combat right now."
    k "我们必须减少法师的数量。所以，我们现在训练的是传统的战斗方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Goat_Tribe_b5b3d750:

    # e "I see. What are you planning to do with them...?"
    e "我明白了。那你打算拿他们怎么办……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Goat_Tribe_ff104b3c:

    # k "Huh? To fight. What else do you think. We're fighting for glory, for the safety of our tribe."
    k "嗯？当然是去战斗。你觉得还能做什么？我们为荣耀而战，也为部族的安危而战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Goat_Tribe_a533e4ef:

    # k "We are talking about none other than honour. And being the general, I will lead my fellow soldiers to whereever they need to be."
    k "我们谈论的无非就是荣誉。作为将军，我会带领同袍前往任何需要他们去的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Goat_Tribe_87385180:

    # k "You either cowardly live, or die with honour."
    k "要么懦弱地活着，要么光荣地死去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Goat_Tribe_faa7d97b:

    # e "Hmm..."
    e "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Goat_Tribe_b9a90435:

    # e "You're so cute when you talk like this."
    e "你这样说话的时候真可爱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Goat_Tribe_ddbc5ca2:

    # k "W-what?"
    k "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Goat_Tribe_ab241627:

    # k "F-fuck you. I am being serious here."
    k "去、去你的。我可是认真的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_a4091800:

    # e "H-hey, general. How's the practices lately."
    e "嘿，将军，最近训练得怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_ef64eead:

    # "Kari pauses a moment, face contorting as if he were remembering a particularly unpleasant experience."
    "卡里停顿了片刻，脸上的表情扭曲起来，仿佛想起了某段格外不愉快的经历。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_7e160790:

    # k "I have a request to ask of you."
    k "我有件事想请你帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_031d0ab4:

    # e "Oh? The Great General is asking me for help?"
    e "哦？大将军居然有事要找我帮忙？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_5d3ec938:

    # "It is entertaining to watch Kari try and rub his forehead to nurse a growing headache, only to be stopped by the bone of his mask."
    "看着卡里试图揉揉额头，缓解逐渐加剧的头痛，却被面具上的骨头挡住了，实在有些好笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_8e9fe151:

    # k "Yes, Courier, though only because Furkan convinced me it would be a good idea."
    k "没错，信使，不过只是因为弗坎说服了我，让我觉得这么做是个好主意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_a6c04dae:

    # e "That makes sense. So, what do you want me to do?"
    e "这就说得通了。那么，你想让我做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_36f6c5a6:

    # k "Well, as you know, we've been running out of rune power."
    k "嗯，你也知道，我们的符文力量快要耗尽了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_b9cf077e:

    # k "As such, many of our warriors have been recruited to train in non-magical combat."
    k "因此，我们征召了许多战士，让他们训练非魔法战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_89ffb216:

    # k "Results have left much to be desired."
    k "但训练成果实在不尽如人意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_0e57c851:

    # "This is an understatement. You see all of one goat warrior training right now, the rest petulantly sitting around."
    "这还算说得客气了。你看，现在就只有一名羊族战士在训练，其余人全都赌气坐在一旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_a00107bf:

    # e "And you want me to help them train?"
    e "你想让我帮他们训练？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_c5309407:

    # k "Yes. Specifically, I want you to spar them."
    k "没错。具体来说，我想让你和他们对练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_c6a78926:

    # k "I hate to say it, but being beaten so soundly by someone they've never met will likely motivate them."
    k "我也不想这么说，但被一个素未谋面的人狠狠击败，应该能激励他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_78dfb780:

    # e "I thought you of all people would be okay with seeing your warriors learn lessons the hard way."
    e "我还以为，偏偏是你，应该不会介意看着自己的战士以这种惨痛的方式吸取教训。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_2a8733b9:

    # k "Yes, but I am unhappy that you are stronger than them, courier."
    k "没错，但我不高兴你比他们更强，信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_5e084a48:

    # k "But after your performance in the cave, I must acknowledge your strength as a warrior."
    k "不过，鉴于你在洞穴中的表现，我必须承认你作为战士的实力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_e5309eb7:

    # e "You know, it's kind of cute to hear you compliment me like that."
    e "你知道吗，听你这么夸我，感觉还挺可爱的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_e7cb8780:

    # k "Not a compliment."
    k "不算夸奖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_52cc48a1:

    # e "Still cute."
    e "还是很可爱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_e9c215c4:

    # "A murderous smile is creeping across Kari's face at this point."
    "这时，卡里脸上渐渐浮现出一抹杀气腾腾的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_c915a93c:

    # "You fear you may have gone a bit too far."
    "你开始担心自己是不是有点过火了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_ff5f744b:

    # k "Call me cute one more time, and we'll see how cute you think I am after you have this rod shoved 5 feet up your ass."
    k "再叫我一次可爱，等这根棍子捅进你屁股五英尺后，我们就知道你还觉得我有多可爱了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_dea99fd3:

    # "It takes great effort not to tease him for his word choice, but you have to, for your own safety."
    "你费了好大劲才忍住没拿他的措辞打趣，不过为了自身安全，你不得不忍住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_36859729:

    # e "So, how do I start?"
    e "那我该怎么开始？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_ff00c4aa:

    # k "I'm going to assume you mean sparring. Well."
    k "我就当你说的是切磋。好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_63908825:

    # k "I presume you are not ready yet. Am I not right...?" nointeract
    k "我猜你还没准备好。不是吗……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_e03257e0:

    # e "I'm ready."
    e "我准备好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_ca52ad3e:

    # e "I am going to need some time to prepare..."
    e "我需要一点时间准备……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_Warrior_Practice_17f263d0:

    # k "Fair. I'll be waiting with my warriors."
    k "行。我会和我的战士们一起等着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Warrior_Practice_Start_187b9279:

    # "Kari nods, he steps away from you and turns to face the guards."
    "卡里点点头，离开你身边，转身面向守卫们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Warrior_Practice_Start_afddffad:

    # k "ATTENTION."
    k "注意！"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Warrior_Practice_Start_aea7f2d8:

    # "Despite being in a wide open space, Kari's booming voice manages to echo from sheer volume alone."
    "明明身处一片开阔地，卡里洪亮的声音却单凭音量便回荡开来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Warrior_Practice_Start_030dbe77:

    # "Every goat in the camp ducks, covering their ears, before turning towards Kari and snapping to attention."
    "营地里的每只山羊都先缩头捂住耳朵，随后转向卡里，立刻立正。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Warrior_Practice_Start_850140a3:

    # k "TODAY, A GUEST WILL BE JOINING US FOR TRAINING, THE COURIER [e]."
    k "今天，一位客人将加入我们的训练——信使[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Warrior_Practice_Start_1e681ace:

    # k "HE WILL BE YOUR SPARRING PARTNER. DO YOUR BEST TO BEAT HIM WITHOUT USING MAGIC."
    k "他将是你们的切磋对手。尽你们所能，在不使用魔法的情况下击败他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Warrior_Practice_Start_3ba4e488:

    # "Any hopeful sounds coming from the assembled goats turn to groans at the words 'without using magic'."
    "集合的山羊们原本发出的欢呼声，在听到“不使用魔法”这几个字后，都变成了呻吟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Warrior_Practice_Start_82499a1d:

    # e "Well, line up for the sparring, I guess."
    e "好吧，排好队来切磋……我猜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Warrior_Practice_Start_ffa1bcb6:

    # "A line of goats gripping spears quickly forms."
    "很快，一队手握长矛的山羊排成了队。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Warrior_Practice_Start_68a7ef99:

    # "The first goat in that line approaches."
    "队伍中的第一只山羊走了过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_e9ff3f0d:

    # k "I'm surprised you lost to them."
    k "我很惊讶你居然输给了他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_9a6549cb:

    # e "Maybe they're stronger than you think?"
    e "也许他们比你想的更强？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_b5ddd391:

    # k "No, you're just weaker than I thought."
    k "不，你只是比我想的更弱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_72f735b3:

    # k "That or you didn't really try."
    k "要不就是你根本没认真。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_c99914ed:

    # "The assembled goats look like they've eaten a particularly sour lemon."
    "集合起来的山羊们看起来像吃了特别酸的柠檬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_fa72849d:

    # gtr "Why can't you just believe that we're strong?"
    gtr "你就不能相信我们很强吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_4c68da1a:

    # k "Because none of you have ever come close to beating me, even two on one."
    k "因为你们谁都从没接近过击败我，哪怕是二打一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_490f7492:

    # k "I am your general, not your paragon."
    k "我是你们的将军，不是你们的典范。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_4305ad19:

    # k "If we want to be able to protect the tree, and find the one who stole the rune, we have to be stronger than this."
    k "想要保护那棵树，找到偷走符文的人，我们就必须变得比现在更强。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_e2c12b54:

    # "It's unclear if Kari is trying to convince the recruits or himself at this point."
    "此刻还不清楚卡里是在说服那些新兵，还是在说服自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_72ef96ae:

    # k "You see, our soldiers are not up to battle standard, but it seems you'd need more experience to, teach them."
    k "你看，我们的士兵还达不到战斗标准，不过看来你得积累更多经验，才能教会他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_77477d1d:

    # e "I guess so."
    e "我想是吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_a71be26a:

    # k "Then, we'll see you next time, recover soon."
    k "那就下次再见。你快点恢复。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Lose_1b479bda:

    # e "See you, Kari."
    e "回头见，卡里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_ba4a0b3d:

    # gtr "F-fuck..."
    gtr "操……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_74bbc763:

    # "Kari is looking at the horny goat with a mix of disgust and contempt."
    "卡里看着那只发情的山羊，眼中满是厌恶和鄙夷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_9700fae3:

    # "He turns his gaze to look at you, and the expression only intensifies."
    "他转过目光看向你，那表情变得更加严厉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_4e312f3e:

    # k "That is not how a warrior fights."
    k "战士不是这么战斗的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_4597dfdd:

    # e "Well, it worked, no?"
    e "不过，这不是奏效了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_92f8c621:

    # k "Yes, but still, one should not debase themselves to win. Morality has a purpose in this world."
    k "是的，但即便如此，也不该为了获胜而自甘堕落。道德在这个世界自有其意义。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_c56bb076:

    # k "It is like how one could earn much money stealing from their fellow man, but does not because they should not."
    k "就像一个人可以靠偷窃同胞的钱财赚得盆满钵满，却不会这么做，因为那是不该做的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_3815a1be:

    # e "I strongly disagree. A fight won through flirtation is much less harmful than one won through violence."
    e "我强烈反对。用调情赢下的战斗，远没有用暴力赢下的战斗那么有害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_eec20efb:

    # "Kari is still disgusted, but accepts this for what it is."
    "卡里仍然感到恶心，但接受了这一事实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_1428edd5:

    # k "Regardless, you have shown a weakness we must work on."
    k "不管怎样，你暴露出了一项我们必须加以改进的弱点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_95d1aa03:

    # k "Everyone, I am disgusted by your show of animalistic lust."
    k "各位，你们表现出的兽性淫欲令我作呕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_491572e9:

    # gt "As if you could do better!"
    gt "就好像你能做得更好似的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_db79181f:

    # "Kari walks over and hits the protesting goat over the head with his staff."
    "卡里走过去，用他的手杖敲了敲那只抗议的山羊的脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_9863b47d:

    # k "I can and did do better. I watched the entire affair, and was completely unaffected."
    k "我能，而且确实做得更好。我全程都看着，完全不受影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_f6d02df0:

    # "You are pretty sure he is lying somewhat, but he certainly showed more restraint than his warriors."
    "你很确定他多少有些在撒谎，但他的克制确实比那些战士强得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_7e395613:

    # k "Work on your discipline, both in not talking back to your general, and in controlling your lust."
    k "好好磨炼你的自制力，既别顶撞你的将军，也要控制住自己的欲望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_f8cb1a5e:

    # k "We must be strong. Must be prepared."
    k "我们必须变得强大，必须做好准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_fffa877b:

    # k "If we are not, we may lose more than just the rune."
    k "否则，我们失去的可能就不只是一枚符文了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_1ba6f454:

    # k "No matter what, we must keep the tribe safe."
    k "无论如何，我们都必须保护部落的安全。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_e9e85741:

    # k "Huh, thanks for breaking his spirit on his day one, Courier."
    k "哼，信使，谢谢你在他第一天就挫败了他的斗志。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_0d2e296c:

    # k "I think we have a clear winner."
    k "我想，胜负已经很明显了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_71bcc4e0:

    # "There is a collective groan at this declaration, though nobody can quite disagree."
    "听到这番宣判，众人齐齐发出一阵呻吟，尽管谁也无法完全反驳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_9f621173:

    # k "I think it's clear that you all need to work on your non-magical combat."
    k "我想很明显，你们都得好好练练非魔法战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_083a1caa:

    # gt "Why can't we just keep using magic! We still have the tree!"
    gt "为什么我们不能继续使用魔法！我们不是还有那棵树吗！"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_25a013b2:

    # k "The tree does not supply nearly enough magic for that."
    k "那棵树提供的魔力远远不够。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_ca03947b:

    # k "Maintaining our buildings and water supply is already straining what it can produce."
    k "维护建筑和供水已经让它的产能不堪重负了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_0870f279:

    # e "Is it really that bad?"
    e "真有那么糟吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_86d607e1:

    # k "Yes. That is why we need to find the rune as soon as possible, and make sure nobody disturbs the tree."
    k "是的。所以我们必须尽快找到符文，还要确保没人打扰那棵树。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_a51c44c6:

    # "Just as Kari finishes his lecture, Furkan appears from the center of the tribe."
    "卡里刚讲完这番训话，弗坎便从部落中央现身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_591ebd01:

    # f "Oh, hello there [e]! I couldn't help but overhear our general talking about the situation with the tree."
    f "哦，你好啊，[e]！我无意中听到了我们的将军在谈论那棵树的情况。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_a8e0f45e:

    # k "We've already talked about this chieftain..."
    k "这件事我们已经谈过了，酋长……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_325a327e:

    # f "Yes, but we've never agreed on it."
    f "是的，但我们从未就此达成一致。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_3a2b502f:

    # "Kari looks a bit unhappy about that, but can't quite disagree."
    "卡里对此显得有些不悦，却又无法完全反驳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_087e7315:

    # k "Yes... but should we not talk about this in private, chieftain?"
    k "是……但酋长，我们难道不该私下谈这件事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_92d14db7:

    # k "It involves quite confidential information."
    k "这涉及相当机密的信息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_52b68439:

    # f "Perhaps, but I wanted to get [e]'s opinion on the matter."
    f "或许吧，但我想听听[e]对此事的看法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_506e2f46:

    # "Kari looks surprised, and a bit tired, but still nods his head in assent."
    "卡里看起来有些惊讶，也有些疲惫，但还是点头表示同意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_c58e4881:

    # k "Well, if it's alright with you then, I will order everyone else to clear out."
    k "嗯，如果你不介意，那我就让其他人都离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_76a07bb8:

    # "Furkan gives an assenting nod."
    "弗坎点头表示同意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_5148fcfd:

    # "Kari turns to face the other goats present."
    "卡里转身面向在场的其他山羊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_70c9020f:

    # k "Everybody, we will cover how to improve on your performance today at a later date."
    k "各位，今天该如何提升表现，我们改日再谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_4845ee92:

    # k "Please vacate the premises to allow for an impromptu meeting."
    k "请离开这里，好让我们临时开个会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_aea116d9:

    # "With a chorus of unhappy grumbles, the surrounding goats clear out, returning to their normal activities."
    "周围的山羊纷纷不满地嘟囔着离开，回去做平时的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_e96ef95d:

    # e "If I can ask... why do you want my opinion?"
    e "如果我可以问的话……你为什么想听听我的意见？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_0d9c3c74:

    # k "Not to be rude or doubt you, chieftain, but I was wondering the same."
    k "我不是想冒犯您，也不是在怀疑您，酋长，但我也正想问同样的问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_e54fa625:

    # f "Well, you saved me... I can't think of anything else that could make me trust you more."
    f "嗯，你救过我……我想不出还有什么能让你更信任我了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_3f9edfba:

    # "Furkan's face is completely genuine and trusting as he says this."
    "他说这话时，弗坎的神情真挚而充满信任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_70b51dee:

    # "He really does believe that you'll pick the right thing."
    "他是真的相信你会做出正确的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_7f54bea7:

    # k "I don't trust you as much as the chieftain does, but... I trust him on any decision he makes."
    k "我不像酋长那样信任你，但是……无论他做出什么决定，我都信任他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_32e417b5:

    # e "Well, I don't really know what I'm supposed to be choosing between."
    e "嗯，我其实不知道自己要在什么之间做选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_cb01c37a:

    # f "Right, was getting to that."
    f "对，我正要说到这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_8f27c0c1:

    # f "You have already heard most of Kari's thoughts, but I will let him elaborate."
    f "你已经听过卡里的大部分想法了，不过，还是让他详细说明吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_84f0fb0c:

    # "Furkan turns to Kari, nodding his head to signal him to explain."
    "弗坎转向卡里，点了点头，示意他解释。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_23112146:

    # k "As he said, you've heard most of it, but."
    k "就像他说的，你们已经听过大部分内容了，不过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_03b7e878:

    # k "I think we should keep our warriors trained and guarding the tree."
    k "我认为我们应该让战士们保持训练，并守卫那棵树。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_acd0992b:

    # k "Protect the last source of magic to our last breath, and through that, protect ourselves."
    k "我们要守护最后的魔力来源，直到生命的最后一刻，也借此保护我们自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_c5f6aeb4:

    # "Kari emphasizes the end of this statement by tapping his staff against the ground."
    "卡里用法杖敲了敲地面，以此强调这句话的结尾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_bea49471:

    # "He then turns to face Furkan, bowing slightly."
    "随后，他转身面向弗坎，微微鞠了一躬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_c0bb195a:

    # f "You know you do not have to do that, Kari."
    f "你知道的，卡里，你不必这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_b007bf71:

    # "Kari gets out of his bow, as if he hadn't heard that."
    "卡里起身直立，仿佛没听见他的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_e40234ba:

    # k "I just want to show the proper respect to my chieftain, and thank him for letting me express my opinion."
    k "我只是想向我的酋长表达应有的敬意，也感谢他允许我表达自己的意见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_cf15db7c:

    # "Furkan lets out a small sigh, likely too small for Kari to have noticed."
    "弗坎轻轻叹了口气，声音小得卡里大概都没注意到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_3c8ca958:

    # f "Well, I respect your feelings on the matter, both regarding respect for me, and the tree."
    f "好吧，我尊重你对此事的看法——无论是对我的尊重，还是对那棵树的尊重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_6713e3e8:

    # f "However, I believe the correct choice of action is to withdraw our troops from the tree."
    f "不过，我认为正确的做法是让我们的部队撤离那棵树。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_f2d76711:

    # e "Wait, why?! Isn't it literally holding your village together with its magic?"
    e "等等，为什么？！它不是确实靠魔法维系着你们的村子吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_541f49e2:

    # f "Yes, it is."
    f "是的，确实如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_21349790:

    # "Furkan takes a breath before continuing, as if convincing himself to keep going."
    "弗坎深吸一口气才继续说下去，仿佛是在说服自己坚持下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_fd19fdec:

    # f "But we can survive without it for a while."
    f "但没有它，我们暂时也能活下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_0d84860b:

    # f "We will have to ration our magic, moreso than ever."
    f "我们得节省魔力，比以往任何时候都更加节省。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_7a1c1d77:

    # f "I want to do this to show the village that we can be trusted, considering how close the tree is to their territory."
    f "我想这么做，是为了向村子证明我们值得信任，毕竟那棵树离他们的领地很近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_bd6ed544:

    # f "Additionally, by retreating the troops, we can hold a tighter perimeter around the village."
    f "此外，撤回部队后，我们就能在村子周围布置更严密的外围防线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_0d14af8d:

    # e "But nobody is attacking it, no? Why do you need to hold that perimeter?"
    e "可没人要攻击它，不是吗？你们为什么需要守住那道防线？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_0065659c:

    # f "We can better track the people of the village by doing this."
    f "这么做，我们就能更好地监视村里的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_35bfca4d:

    # "A pained expression crosses his face."
    "一抹痛苦掠过他的脸庞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_34a48164:

    # f "I believe whoever stole the rune is either in or nearby the village."
    f "我认为偷走符文的人要么就在村子里，要么就在村子附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_8c1954a5:

    # k "The thought hurts me deeply, as I know it hurts our chieftain, but..."
    k "这个念头让我深感痛苦，因为我知道它也让我们的酋长难受，但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_9477a4e3:

    # k "Nobody outside of the village knew where the rune was, so, it's what would make sense."
    k "村外没人知道符文在哪里，所以，这才是最合理的解释。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_1b3456e2:

    # e "Couldn't somebody have just followed you up to where the rune was?"
    e "难道就不能有人一路跟着你们，跟到符文所在的地方吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_8f419e88:

    # f "It is extremely unlikely, as we rarely visited."
    f "这极不可能，因为我们很少去那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_c673552e:

    # f "Additionally, the guardians would have reacted and attacked anyone who was not of our tribe."
    f "而且，守卫肯定会有所反应，攻击任何不属于我们部族的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_ac866a08:

    # f "Considering they did it while our leader... was distracted from the caravan."
    f "考虑到他们是在我们的首领……被商队分散注意力时动的手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_d8c6bf62:

    # f "It is a loathsome conclusion, but the one that makes the most sense."
    f "这是个令人憎恶的结论，但也是最合理的解释。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_76681718:

    # f "Regardless, those are our positions."
    f "不管怎样，这就是我们的立场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_230a33bb:

    # "Both turn to face you."
    "两人都转身面向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_98a6cb4c:

    # f "Well [e], what do you think?" nointeract
    f "那么，[e]，你怎么看？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_5ff7f246:

    # e "I'd say... keep the huntsmen there?"
    e "我觉得……让猎人们留在那里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_1aa392a9:

    # k "Well..."
    k "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_7192ffbc:

    # k "Thank you for helping the chieftain and I reach an agreement on this."
    k "谢谢你帮助酋长和我就此达成一致。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_670fde36:

    # "You have a feeling Kari is mainly thankful that he doesn't have to leave the tree unguarded."
    "你觉得卡里主要是在庆幸自己不用留下看守那棵树。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_05de4eec:

    # f "If you believe that is for the best, [e], I will trust your decision, as much as mine and Kari's."
    f "如果你认为那是最好的，[e]，我会相信你的决定，就像相信我和卡里的决定一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_3d21572d:

    # k "I will continue to train our troops to be ready for any attack."
    k "我会继续训练我们的部队，让他们做好应对任何攻击的准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_3987168f:

    # f "Thank you for doing so."
    f "谢谢你这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_a38e33a1:

    # f "There is no one I would rather trust with our safety."
    f "没有谁比你更值得我托付我们的安危。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_73cff794:

    # "Furkan sighs sadly."
    "弗坎悲伤地叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_944eb4ea:

    # f "Now there is only the question of how else we could patch up relationships with Lusterfield..."
    f "现在只剩下一个问题：我们还能如何修复与卢斯特菲尔德的关系……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_4abdaa0c:

    # f "Both groups have yet to recover... the wounds cut deep, and scarred into prejudice and distrust."
    f "双方都还没有恢复过来……伤口深深刻下了偏见与不信任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_afb937ed:

    # f "If we wish to have any future cooperation or mutual existence in general, it should be done."
    f "若想让双方今后继续合作，或至少共存下去，就必须这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_49257c1d:

    # k "I understand chieftain. I think we should make amends as well."
    k "我明白了，酋长。我也认为我们应该弥补过错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_27828109:

    # k "Hopefully, we will have ample opportunity to when we have the rune back."
    k "希望等我们拿回符文后，会有充足的机会这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_62f114fb:

    # "Furkan looks slightly melancholy."
    "弗坎看起来有些忧郁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_b4b6d55d:

    # f "Well, we will protect what we have for now."
    f "嗯，我们暂且会保护好已有的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_ec6804d9:

    # f "Thank you again, [e]. I hope to see you again soon."
    f "再次谢谢你，[e]。希望很快能再见到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_380a19fc:

    # f "And of course, thank you as always, Kari."
    f "当然，也一如既往地谢谢你，卡里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_c0815fc1:

    # "With that, Furkan leaves, a cloud of wistful bygones hanging over his head."
    "说完，弗坎离开了，头顶仿佛笼罩着一片对往昔的惆怅阴云。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_c8fc4cd6:

    # e "Kari, you look like you want to say something, what is it?"
    e "卡里，你看起来像是想说什么，是什么事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_8e758ae7:

    # "Furkan's head whips back up, seemingly jolted out of his pensive haze."
    "弗坎猛地抬起头来，似乎从沉思的恍惚中惊醒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_28859260:

    # k "Well, I didn't want to say anything, as it wasn't something I had the right to tell my chieftain."
    k "嗯，我本不想说什么，因为那不是我有资格告诉酋长的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_b6a7fefb:

    # f "Okay, then do not tell your chieftain."
    f "好，那就别告诉你的酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_ddbb3d0a:

    # f "Tell a fellow tribesman, Kari. I have not always been chieftain, nor you my general."
    f "那就把它告诉一个同族之人吧，卡里。我也不是一直都是酋长，你也不是一直都是我的将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_304724b9:

    # f "I value your opinion as an equal, even if we are not so."
    f "我重视你作为平等之人的意见，即便我们并非平等。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_4d75b5b4:

    # k "I just wanted to say thank you for listening to me. Even if it wasn't how I thought it would go..."
    k "我只是想谢谢你愿意听我说。虽然事情的发展并不是我原本以为的那样……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_c7acb306:

    # k "...You're doing great."
    k "……你做得很棒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_df6855a3:

    # f "I'm glad one of us thinks so."
    f "看来我们之中总有一个人这么认为。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_6084a5a3:

    # f "I'll keep trying my best."
    f "我会继续尽力的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_c81b2c93:

    # "And with that, both goats flash each other quick smiles, radiating a warmth you hadn't seen from them before."
    "说完，两人冲彼此露出短暂的笑容，散发出一股你此前从未在他们身上见过的温暖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_f3002751:

    # f "I should get back to work at the tent."
    f "我该回帐篷干活了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_184f0f85:

    # k "I'll see you there."
    k "到那儿见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_ca3f157c:

    # "Furkan walks off, whatever somber mood had enveloped him seemingly gone for now."
    "弗坎走开了，笼罩着他的那股阴郁情绪暂时似乎已经消散。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_4142e697:

    # k "Courier. I would not have trusted you with making this decision, but I cannot say I regret it."
    k "信使。要让你来做这个决定，我本来是不会放心的，但也不能说我后悔了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_5a04e2c8:

    # e "...you're welcome?"
    e "……不客气？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_6e5fe1f5:

    # k "Fair enough."
    k "也算合理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_4d9602b7:

    # "Kari chuckles a bit at your clear confusion."
    "卡里看你明显的困惑，轻笑了几声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_ae07ce51:

    # k "I'm off to go find where my recruits have run off to. Picking berries or something, surely."
    k "我得去找找我的新兵跑哪儿去了。肯定是去摘浆果之类的了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_dbee576e:

    # "And with that, Kari struts off, leaving you alone once more."
    "说完，卡里大摇大摆地离开，再次留下你独自一人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_508b7c02:

    # f "Thank you for your candor."
    f "谢谢你的坦诚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_2dc7693d:

    # k "I hope you have the right reasons for making the decision you have, but, I see the wisdom in the position."
    k "我希望你做出这个决定是出于正确的理由，但我也看到了这种立场中的智慧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_5c1afedb:

    # "Kari doesn't seem to be a sore loser going by his eyes. They are filled with distrust rather than frustration."
    "从他的眼神来看，卡里似乎并不是个输不起的人。他眼中充满了不信任，而非沮丧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_9792827d:

    # f "If he had wanted to hurt us, he could have back when I was trapped in the cave."
    f "如果他想伤害我们，我被困在洞穴里的时候，他本可以那么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_f96ec317:

    # k "I understand, I just want to protect you and our tribe, chieftain."
    k "我明白，我只是想保护你和我们的部落，酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_63e92d27:

    # "Furkan looks to be on the edge of saying something, but can't quite bring himself to."
    "弗坎看起来想要说些什么，却始终没能说出口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_5a56cbaa:

    # "Looking across at Kari, you can see that he sees the same as you, but sees himself as too low rank to speak on it."
    "看向卡里，你能看出他也看到了同样的情况，但认为自己的地位太低，不够资格对此发言。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_f8044169:

    # "Seeing Furkan will not in fact say what he wants to, Kari opens his mouth to speak."
    "见弗坎终究说不出想说的话，卡里便张口说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_70663843:

    # k "I need to go tell the warriors of this change of plans."
    k "我得去把计划有变的消息告诉战士们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_8424a99a:

    # k "I will report back to the tent when I am done."
    k "我办完后会回帐篷汇报。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_58e5184a:

    # "With that, Kari walks out in the direction the majority of the goat warriors went."
    "说完，卡里朝大多数山羊战士离去的方向走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_280d2c91:

    # e "Furk, what's wrong?"
    e "弗坎，怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_668ea3f8:

    # f "Nothing is wrong, I just..."
    f "没什么不对，我只是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_d6aa7379:

    # "You can see Furkan take in a deep breath, preparing to take the leap and say whatever it is he's been thinking."
    "你看见弗坎深吸一口气，似乎准备鼓起勇气说出一直藏在心里的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_16c0bf7e:

    # f "Kari, I want you to know that I trust you to protect the tribe, and myself."
    f "卡里，我想让你知道，我信任你能保护部落，也能保护我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_2640c2f4:

    # f "There is nobody I trust more than you."
    f "没有人能像你一样得到我的信任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_d5b7a6d7:

    # "Kari bows low, like a knight accepting their oath."
    "卡里深深鞠躬，像骑士接受誓言一般。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_5a27427a:

    # k "Thank you chieftain, I appreciate your trust in my abilities as a general."
    k "谢谢你，酋长。我很感激你信任我作为将军的能力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_253799b8:

    # f "No, Kari. It is not about you as a general, though I trust that as well."
    f "不，卡里。这不是说你作为将军的事，尽管这一点我也信任你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_740ea3d2:

    # f "You have always supported me, since we were children, even up until now."
    f "从我们还是孩子的时候起，直到现在，你一直都在支持我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_e5d617ad:

    # f "I trust you, and you, Kari, will always have that trust."
    f "我信任你，而你，卡里，也永远拥有这份信任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_1064b379:

    # f "General of the goats or not."
    f "不管你是不是山羊族的将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_e9609d4f:

    # k "I... I trust you as well, chieftain - Furkan."
    k "我……我也信任你，酋长——弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_c8c80c3f:

    # "Kari's cheeks are a bit flushed, clearly embarrassed by saying that."
    "卡里的脸颊微微泛红，显然为说出这番话感到害羞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_9838ff6b:

    # k "Now, to make good on that trust of yours, I will go tell the warriors about our change of plans."
    k "现在，为了不辜负你的信任，我要去把计划改变的事告诉战士们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_f886febe:

    # "Swiftly exiting the scene, Kari heads in the direction most of the goat warriors disappeared to."
    "卡里迅速离开现场，朝大多数山羊战士消失的方向走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_ee4470b2:

    # "You are left with an affectionately chuckling Furkan."
    "你身边只剩下亲昵地轻笑着的弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_873fae08:

    # f "Well, [e], I appreciate what you have done for us today."
    f "嗯，[e]，我很感激你今天为我们所做的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_7b8f850d:

    # e "I would do it anytime, Furk."
    e "随时都可以，弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_a93d4d94:

    # f "I know. You are a great friend to the tribe."
    f "我知道。你是部落的好朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_bed95126:

    # "You can't help but think Furkan looks quite cute right now."
    "你不禁觉得弗坎现在的样子相当可爱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_fb13942b:

    # "His cheeks are a bit red, and he is rubbing the back of his head."
    "他的脸颊有些发红，还在揉着后脑勺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_04151022:

    # f "...and a great friend to me."
    f "……也是我的好朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_7961e191:

    # e "You give me too much credit, I am just a courier who does his best to help."
    e "你太抬举我了，我只是一个尽力帮忙的信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_1102513e:

    # f "Well, simple courier, you have my thanks."
    f "好吧，普通的信使，感谢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_6f6abdca:

    # f "I do need to return to work now, but... I hope to see you around soon."
    f "我现在确实得回去工作了，不过……希望很快还能再见到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_cc677afc:

    # f "It's always a pleasant sight."
    f "看到你总是令人愉快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_fe51fbe5:

    # "You can't help but blush at the implications of that statement."
    "你不禁因这句话的弦外之音红了脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_62a18040:

    # e "Hehe... Thank you Furkan. See you soon!"
    e "呵呵……谢谢你，弗坎。回头见！"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_d11cac61:

    # "Furkan heads towards the hut, leaving you alone once more."
    "弗坎朝小屋走去，再次留下你独自一人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_c9704f22:

    # "You have received 200 gold and 700 experience."
    "你获得了200枚金币和700点经验。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Goat_Practice_Win_91f1d522:

    # msg "You are now Level [pc.level]! Check your inventory to allocate your level points."
    msg "你现在是[pc.level]级！查看你的物品栏，分配升级点数。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_General_3ba645f8:

    # e "How did you become the general...?"
    e "你是怎么当上将军的……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_General_d095e658:

    # k "Furkan's father, Tevfik trained me to become the protector of the tribe."
    k "弗坎的父亲特夫菲克训练我，让我成为部族的守护者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_General_84d6ccfb:

    # k "I used to play with Furk, hang out. while his father was the chief."
    k "我以前常和弗坎一起玩、一起消磨时光，那时他父亲还是族长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_General_30e8933c:

    # k "Those were the days, where we both do not need to care about anything."
    k "那段日子真好，我们都不用操心任何事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_General_8b1caf28:

    # e "But do you like being the general?"
    e "不过，你喜欢当将军吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_General_efdfb978:

    # k "How can I not? I have to protect the tribe, protect Furkan."
    k "我怎么能不喜欢？我必须保护部族，保护弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_General_a8dddcb1:

    # k "Everything is on the line now, I can't let my own desire sabotage what we've been building."
    k "如今一切都岌岌可危，我不能让自己的欲望毁掉我们一直在建立的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_General_77f23f7e:

    # e "You need to relax sometimes..."
    e "你有时也得放松一下……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_General_1628b624:

    # k "I am relaxing."
    k "我现在就在放松。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_General_a3f2d3bb:

    # k "What else to you think I'm doing."
    k "不然你以为我在做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_General_274daa9f:

    # e "Hmmm..."
    e "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_1f9ae8df:

    # e "How are you doing, General."
    e "将军，最近过得怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_940e52f6:

    # k "I'm talking with Furkan."
    k "我在和弗坎谈话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_28d05d0f:

    # e "I see, can I help you?"
    e "我能帮忙吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_bdf5339c:

    # k "Help- w-what?"
    k "帮——什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_128bd630:

    # e "Uhm... nothing."
    e "呃……没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_cc625950:

    # k "Training my troops."
    k "训练我的部下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_4bb7a058:

    # e "It doesn't look like they're... training."
    e "看起来他们……不像是在训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_bf56d097:

    # k "They're just rebellious, after their training we'll send them to the ancient tree anyway."
    k "他们只是有点叛逆，训练结束后反正还是要把他们送到古树那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_06ff72ad:

    # e "Some of them really don't like using these weapons."
    e "他们中的一些人确实很不喜欢使用这些武器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_323dcb9b:

    # k "I won't waste my energy on them, just let them sit there and think about their poor decisions."
    k "我才不想在他们身上浪费力气，就让他们待在那里，好好想想自己那些糟糕的决定吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_50afd1d4:

    # e "Uhm..."
    e "唔……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_ddbc5ca2:

    # k "W-what?"
    k "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_How_Doing_376d2dc7:

    # e "N-nothing."
    e "没、没什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_End_e89acd94:

    # e "That's all, general, I'll see you... later?"
    e "就这样了，将军，我们……以后再见？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Dialogue_End_361c6fec:

    # k "See you... Courier."
    k "回头见……信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_5d8de010:

    # "You cautiously walk towards the direction Lothar sent you."
    "你小心翼翼地朝洛萨尔让你去的方向走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_96a44609:

    # "Soon, you discover the huge tribe area."
    "很快，你发现了这片庞大的部落区域。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_be9fb4f4:

    # "The tribe is lined with almost hundreds of huts, spread throughout the mountains."
    "部落里几乎到处都是棚屋，成百上千间遍布整片山脉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_90c44898:

    # "You see two guards at the entrance of the goat tribe, standing carelessly."
    "你看见山羊部落入口处有两名守卫，正漫不经心地站在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_8d8227f0:

    # e "Ahem- Hey!! Hey!!"
    e "咳——喂！！喂！！"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_b52bc581:

    # goatguard "..."
    goatguard "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_143e4c4b:

    # goatguard "Who are you?"
    goatguard "你是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_8d8f6003:

    # e "I- I- uhh... I'm lost."
    e "我、我、呃……我迷路了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_429febd3:

    # goatguard "I haven't seen you kind here, where're you from?"
    goatguard "我没在这里见过你这种人，你从哪儿来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_683ebfb2:

    # e "Uhm I'm from." nointeract
    e "呃……我是从……" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_412dde89:

    # e "I'm from Puro. Have you heard?"
    e "我来自普罗。你听说过吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_3a0ee0aa:

    # goatguard "No?"
    goatguard "没有？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_1ed158c9:

    # e "Really, I thought there's a dragon who looked like me?"
    e "真的？我还以为有条长得像我的龙来过你们这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_5ea46a05:

    # goatguard "Look I don't know where you're from... maybe I can ask when our huntsmen come back."
    goatguard "听着，我不知道你来自哪里……也许等我们的猎人回来后，我可以帮你问问。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_10a9f63c:

    # e "H-hey I just need a direction, and I'll go."
    e "喂——我只需要你给我指个方向，然后我就走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_d5ecfce0:

    # goatguard "Alright."
    goatguard "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_717db05d:

    # e "I'm from Lusterfield. I'm a courier. Look."
    e "我来自卢斯特菲尔德，是一名信使。你看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_dca3ca57:

    # goatguard "Ugh, fucking Lusterfolks."
    goatguard "啧，该死的卢斯特菲尔德人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_5956abe5:

    # goatguard "What do you want, you can't enter the tribe, I've warned you."
    goatguard "你到底想干什么？你不能进入部落，我已经警告过你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_d1025f4f:

    # e "Alright- you don't need to. I just need a direction, and I'll go."
    e "好吧——不用了。我只要知道方向，自己走就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_a69ee3a4:

    # goatguard "Ok, where do you want to go?"
    goatguard "好，你想去哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_24d70927:

    # e "I'm from the town..? I just got lost in the forest here."
    e "我从镇上来……？只是迷路走进了这片森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_7af3472d:

    # goatguard "Really? From that far away?"
    goatguard "真的吗？从那么远的地方来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_c11b20bb:

    # e "Yes, I just need a direction, and then I'll go."
    e "对，我只要知道方向，然后就走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_2034511c:

    # goatguard "Alright, sure."
    goatguard "好吧，行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_e0848d29:

    # e "Mhmm I want to go to..." nointeract
    e "嗯，我想去……" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_675ebd1a:

    # e "Lusterfield?"
    e "卢斯特菲尔德？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_88530ac9:

    # goatguard "Really? Ehrm."
    goatguard "真的吗？呃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_64a39b57:

    # goatguard "And you said you're from... Lusterfield."
    goatguard "而且你说你是从……卢斯特菲尔德来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_874b0b95:

    # e "Yeah but I didn't know where I am."
    e "对，可我不知道自己现在在哪儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_da65a6b2:

    # goatguard "Lusterfield- Why are you heading there?"
    goatguard "卢斯特菲尔德——你为什么要去那里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_ce1a4a90:

    # e "Just for trading with the lion merchant."
    e "只是想和那里的狮子商人做笔交易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_01f08b8f:

    # e "Haskell's place?"
    e "哈斯克尔的住处？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_c9b9a2e9:

    # goatguard "It's just over there."
    goatguard "就在那边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_b4105bbe:

    # e "Uhmm."
    e "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_155de2e5:

    # goatguard "Just walk until you see the cabin."
    goatguard "你一直走，看到小屋就到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_d83e3f81:

    # e "I don't know I need a map at least so I won't get lost again, Please?"
    e "我不知道……至少给我张地图吧，这样我就不会再迷路了，拜托？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_9e9dc0b8:

    # e "the Town?"
    e "镇子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_6cbf1d91:

    # goatguard "Didn't you say you lived in the town."
    goatguard "你不是说你住在镇上吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_16e0f583:

    # e "Yes, but I don't know where I am... Please?"
    e "对，可我不知道自己现在在哪儿……拜托？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_fa2c7940:

    # goatguard "The town? It's really far away."
    goatguard "镇子？那地方离这儿可远着呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_f18b5235:

    # e "I don't know where it is, I just got lost in this forest."
    e "我不知道它在哪儿，我只是迷路走进了这片森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_c8322ae7:

    # goatguard "Ughh... alright. I'll call the general to make you a map..."
    goatguard "唉……好吧。我去叫将军给你画张地图……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_66fc3a5a:

    # e "Thanks!"
    e "谢谢！"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_2005007e:

    # "The guard leaves you at the entrance of the goat tribe, you try to peek inside but the other guard keeps staring at you."
    "卫兵把你留在山羊部落的入口处。你试着往里面窥探，可另一名卫兵始终盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_0698a6d1:

    # "He is staring at you intensely, almost like he secretly knows about your plan."
    "他目不转睛地盯着你，简直像是暗中知道你的计划。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_cac05fff:

    # "You stand solemnly in place, ignoring the piercing gaze of the guard."
    "你神色庄重地站在原地，无视卫兵那道逼人的目光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_a5fc74c4:

    # "Yet, you feel he is looking at you up and down, he goes around you and searches your bag."
    "然而，你能感觉到他的视线在你身上上下打量；他绕到你身边，搜查你的包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_e78bae6c:

    # e "Hey, what are you doing."
    e "嘿，你在干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_f25c4f7a:

    # goatguard2 "Searching."
    goatguard2 "搜查。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_9c143698:

    # goatguard2 "What t-the."
    goatguard2 "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_30b972c3:

    # goatguard2 "It's... meat. someone elses."
    goatguard2 "这是……肉。别人的肉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_cf9ad2ec:

    # e "Oh, what? No no no, I just took it from the buggbears!"
    e "啊，什么？不不不，我只是从熊地精那里拿来的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_0c4aed9d:

    # goatguard2 "Why would you take it... if not for eating the meat for yourself."
    goatguard2 "你为什么要拿走它……难道不是为了自己吃掉这块肉吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_666e5935:

    # goatguard2 "What kind of sick being are you."
    goatguard2 "你究竟是什么恶心的东西？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_dab0aca2:

    # e "Hey I helped you defeat the buggbears that plagued your outpost over there..."
    e "嘿，我可是帮你们打败了那群侵扰你们哨站的熊地精……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_f986d744:

    # goatguard2 "Watch your mouth stranger."
    goatguard2 "说话注意点，外族人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_6ae935e4:

    # e "Whatever."
    e "随便。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_8bb50e6b:

    # goatguard2 "Nothing suspicious..."
    goatguard2 "没什么可疑的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_defcbf26:

    # e "Now may you get your hand off me?"
    e "现在可以把你的手从我身上拿开了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_e1346f13:

    # goatguard2 "Not if you're so fluffy under there."
    goatguard2 "那可不行，下面不是还有一片毛茸茸的地方没检查吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_7952395f:

    # "You can feel the guard's hand running up and down from the back to your stomach."
    "你能感觉到卫兵的手从后背一路上下摸到腹部。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_a9881667:

    # "His fingers tracing deeper and deeper into your crotch."
    "他的手指越来越深地探入你的胯间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_4c04a5fb:

    # goatguard2 "Is this why you run around the forest... naked. Just for us to grope a feel."
    goatguard2 "你就是为了让我们摸个够，才光着身子在森林里乱跑的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_acd5c5d0:

    # e "Get- off..."
    e "住——住手……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_3840a523:

    # goatguard2 "Alright. I'll leave you be, but I see you showing off your body again here, I can't promise I'll let you go."
    goatguard2 "好吧。我就放过你。不过，要是我再看到你在这里卖弄身体，可不敢保证还会放你走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_274daa9f:

    # e "Hmmm..."
    e "唔……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_13872303:

    # "The goat guard walks back to his guarding duty, while you patiently wait for the other guard to come back."
    "山羊卫兵走回岗位，继续执勤，而你则耐心等待另一名卫兵回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_342ef9b5:

    # "Soon the other guard comes back with another figure, he is wearing a short cowl around his shoulder, and holding a scepter with a bell on top of it."
    "没过多久，另一名卫兵带着一个人回来。那人肩上披着一件短斗篷，手里拿着一根顶端系着铃铛的权杖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_32636830:

    # "He doesn't speak much, only staggering towards you while holding his scepter for balance."
    "他不怎么说话，只是扶着权杖踉踉跄跄地朝你走来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_655602f9:

    # my "Who- is this you say?"
    my "你说——这是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_e6a163e8:

    # goatguard "General, he's from Lusterfield."
    goatguard "报告将军，他来自卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_e6e8e397:

    # goatguard "General, he said he's from Hawk-"
    goatguard "将军，他说自己来自霍克——"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_b7baeeb6:

    # goatguard "General I think he's from the town."
    goatguard "将军，我觉得他是从镇上来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_19c7ef00:

    # e "Hmm ye-"
    e "嗯，是——"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_70537852:

    # gg "And why is he here?"
    gg "那他为什么会在这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_90bfe7aa:

    # goatguard "He said he got lost in the forest, and he asked me for directions, general."
    goatguard "他说自己在森林里迷路了，还向我问路，将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_77926953:

    # gg "Huh... Directions."
    gg "嗯……问路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_5c8c907c:

    # e "Can I sa-"
    e "我能说——"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_ca831d89:

    # "The masked figure turns towards you and stare at your eyes intensely, you can feel the wrath behind his mask..."
    "蒙面人转过身来，死死盯着你的双眼；你能感受到他面具后隐藏的怒火……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_191f25ff:

    # gg "You know something about Furkan don't you."
    gg "你知道弗坎的事，对吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_064ddd59:

    # e "Hmm? Furkan?"
    e "嗯？弗坎？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_fd9d31b0:

    # gg "Furkan. Our Chief. You know where he is, don't you."
    gg "弗坎。我们的族长。你知道他在哪儿，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_7edfef42:

    # e "I- uhh... I don't know? I thought your chief would be in the tribe?"
    e "我——呃……我不知道？我还以为你们的族长应该在部落里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_659b650e:

    # "The news surprised you for a moment, you thought Furkan would be in the Tribe, and it would be somewhat safer to see a familiar face."
    "这个消息让你一时大为惊讶。你原以为弗坎会在部落里，见到一个熟悉的面孔，多少会让你觉得更安全些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_82262834:

    # "But now he's gone, and you are not sure if there's anyone you can actually trust here."
    "但现在他不在了，而你也不确定这里是否真的有谁值得信任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_96e7d9b8:

    # "Not mentioning the person in front of you seem to be suspicious towards you."
    "更别提，面前这个人似乎正对你心存疑虑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_5f213138:

    # "If you say nothing, maybe you can leave this place alive, at least."
    "如果你什么都不说，至少或许还能活着离开这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_4259f957:

    # "But if you say you know Furkan, the general must want more information, that you don't know about."
    "但如果你说认识弗坎，将军肯定会想知道更多，而那些信息你根本不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_1136f8a9:

    # e "Look, look, I don't know anything. I'm just a passerby."
    e "听我说，听我说，我什么都不知道。我只是个路人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_ca84bd2d:

    # gg "Bullshit, I know Furkan said he met a courier from Lusterfield, you seem to fit his description very nicely."
    gg "放屁，我知道弗坎说过他遇到过一个来自卢斯特菲尔德的信使，而你的样子和他的描述非常相符。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_5ce011df:

    # gg "And you say you don't know about him?"
    gg "你却说你不认识他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_47c6f14e:

    # gg "You must have a serious case of dementia, don't you."
    gg "你这失忆失得可真是时候，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_31e6e3be:

    # e "Uh... I don't know, I swear."
    e "呃……我不知道，我发誓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_4f16f873:

    # gg "I gave you a chance, and now you've wasted it."
    gg "我给过你机会，可你现在把它浪费了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_16ec2160:

    # e "Look, I know about him, alright."
    e "听着，我知道他的事，行了吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_8ad190d2:

    # e "I'm a courier from Lusterfield, and he asked me to give a letter to Rahim earlier."
    e "我是从卢斯特菲尔德来的信使，他之前让我把一封信交给雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_5f2abe47:

    # gg "Yes, I know about that. You're lucky that you came forward yourself."
    gg "嗯，这事我知道。你主动坦白，算你走运。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_2efd475d:

    # gg "So, why are you here if not for collecting ransom."
    gg "既然你不是来收赎金的，那你来我们部落做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_096d5c0b:

    # e "I don't know where he is now, I swear. Alright, I made an excuse just to see him here."
    e "我发誓，我不知道他现在在哪儿。好吧，我只是找了个借口，想来这里见他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_4cbbf1cd:

    # gg "Why do you want to see him?"
    gg "你为什么想见他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_a0a4da04:

    # e "Uhh..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_f51de8e0:

    # e "Alright you caught me."
    e "好吧，被你抓到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_e68957ac:

    # e "I'm here to scout any information I can get..."
    e "我是来尽可能打探情报的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_c1492e9d:

    # gg "And you dared to tell me about this?"
    gg "你竟敢把这事告诉我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_6ea96692:

    # e "I don't know... alright. I don't know about anything."
    e "我不知道……行了吧。我什么都不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_94d95b26:

    # e "Except that I'm just a courier."
    e "除了我只是个信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_4c06e445:

    # gg "Wh-who sent you?"
    gg "谁派你来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_cfcce589:

    # e "Lothar, he told me to. Now can I go?"
    e "是洛萨尔，他让我来的。现在我可以走了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_6ebc7109:

    # gg "That monster. I'll kill him myself... once I get my magic back."
    gg "那个怪物。等我的魔力恢复了，我要亲手杀了他……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_cdb0cd91:

    # gg "And don't you dare try to escape now..."
    gg "你现在可别想逃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_30cc8a6f:

    # e "I've told you everything, I don't know where Furkan is."
    e "我已经把一切都告诉你了，我不知道弗坎在哪儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_c5fade14:

    # gg "I know."
    gg "我知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_2d18f501:

    # gg "Guards, seize him."
    gg "卫兵，把他抓起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_3d49a143:

    # e "Ugh... I'm not feeling so good."
    e "呃……我感觉不太好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_e7dfb5ce:

    # goatguard2 "w-what?"
    goatguard2 "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_fec51668:

    # e "I- haven't eaten for a long time."
    e "我——我已经很久没吃东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_77811d73:

    # "You soon falls backwards on to the ground, luckily it's all grass but you can feel a concussion on your butt."
    "你很快便向后倒在地上，幸好这里是草地，但你还是能感觉到屁股摔得一阵发懵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_5bb87b15:

    # "The guard stares at you, not knowing what to do, he then rings his bell on the chest for exactly three times before calling for help."
    "卫兵不知所措地盯着你，随后在呼救前，连续准确地摇了三下胸前的铃铛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_ae25d335:

    # goatguard2 "This guy... he fell! Anyone here to help."
    goatguard2 "这家伙……他倒下了！有人来帮忙吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_b295be86:

    # "Soon, the other guard and a masked figure runs towards your reclined form."
    "很快，另一个卫兵和一个蒙面人朝倒下的你跑来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_e4ff36a6:

    # goatguard "Hey w-what? What did you do to him?"
    goatguard "喂，等、等等？你对他做了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_7bacc4c0:

    # goatguard2 "He said he didn't eat anything and then fainted, how would I even know?"
    goatguard2 "他说自己什么都没吃，然后就昏倒了，我哪知道啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_c07c8910:

    # goatguard "Did you just give him that classic dirty hand?"
    goatguard "你刚才是不是对他使了那种经典的下流手段？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_6a4b4922:

    # goatguard2 "I didn't! But I... planned to."
    goatguard2 "我没有！但我……本来打算来着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_30af2a64:

    # goatguard "You moron."
    goatguard "你这个蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_6ddc9df5:

    # my "Hmm..."
    my "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_de50df7e:

    # my "Let's bring him back to our place."
    my "把他带回我们那里吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_799c699b:

    # goatguard "Wait, are you sure, general? I don't know if chief would like a stranger in our tribe."
    goatguard "等等，将军，您确定吗？我不知道族长会不会喜欢部落里出现一个陌生人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_e44bfaa0:

    # gg "Yes, I'm sure... Or are you willing to just let him die here?"
    gg "没错，我确定……还是说，你想就让他死在这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_7ea088b6:

    # goatguard "General, but he's from Lusterfield."
    goatguard "将军，可他来自卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_07bdba30:

    # goatguard "General, he said he's from Hawk... something."
    goatguard "将军，他说自己来自霍克……什么地方来着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_b7baeeb6_1:

    # goatguard "General I think he's from the town."
    goatguard "将军，我觉得他是从镇上来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_c5fade14_1:

    # gg "I know."
    gg "我知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_3e27ab2d:

    # gg "I'll have to lock him up later and make him spill out any information about Furk, if he has any."
    gg "待会儿我得把他关起来，逼他吐出关于弗克的任何情报，若他真知道的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_e2c84f84:

    # goatguard2 "Oh General, that's a good idea."
    goatguard2 "哦，将军，您英明。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_f371b960:

    # "Your heart stops for a moment here, you're not supposed to be locked up in the Goat Tribe."
    "这下你的心脏停跳了一瞬；你可不该被关进山羊部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_fe85bf6e:

    # "And you thought, at least Furkan would be in the Tribe."
    "而你原本以为，至少弗坎会在部落里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_13bea361:

    # "Not this grouchy general with a delicate voice."
    "不是这个嗓音纤细的暴躁将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_748014cc:

    # "You are not ready to get locked up as a prisoner for no reason at all."
    "你可没准备好无缘无故被当作囚犯关起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_ece626b0:

    # gg "W-wait."
    gg "等、等等。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_14850225:

    # "The general seems to notice you furrowing your brows. He stares at you for a second."
    "将军似乎注意到你皱起了眉头。他盯着你看了一秒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_7562598e:

    # e "OUCH! W-what are you doing."
    e "好痛！你、你在干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_7f453521:

    # gg "Seeing if you are passed out."
    gg "看看你是不是昏过去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_34fc0add:

    # "You screamed as soon as the general touches somewhere near your groin."
    "将军一碰到你腹股沟附近，你就立刻尖叫起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_13caefad:

    # e "Y-you could have chosen somewhere else!"
    e "你、你就不能选别的地方吗！"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_e76f52d5:

    # gg "Uh... Do I look like I care."
    gg "呃……你看我像是在乎吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_63d3ccc7:

    # "The guards turns back at you, looking all dumbfounded."
    "卫兵们回头看向你，一脸目瞪口呆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_d31a8ead:

    # goatguard2 "Didn't he just faint.?"
    goatguard2 "他刚才不是昏过去了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_dbc54696:

    # gg "He faked it. Look at this guy, healthy as a hors-... fit like a fiddle."
    gg "他是装的。看看这家伙，健康得像匹马——呃……精神得很。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_6b70fcfd:

    # e "Uhmm..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_7cb29c68:

    # gg "Who are you... answer now."
    gg "你是谁……现在回答。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_2ea7a35e:

    # e "My Friend and I discovered a golem hand."
    e "我和朋友发现了一只石魔像的手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_395c96d7:

    # e "And they suggested that we should look for Furkan because, it's symbol looks like something from yours."
    e "他们建议我们来找弗坎，因为它上面的符号看起来像你们的某种符号。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_c29390cb:

    # gg "Ugh... let me see."
    gg "啧……给我看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_4b9f89b6:

    # "The deer yanks the stone off your hand, and he shudders for a moment, like coming to a realisation somehow."
    "那头鹿一把将石块从你手中拽走，随后浑身颤抖了片刻，仿佛突然意识到了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_ebe2e9da:

    # gg "Oh."
    gg "哦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_7e5be565:

    # e "What?"
    e "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_b70da06b:

    # gg "He's with the Golem."
    gg "他和石魔像在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_21a76c7c:

    # e "But we killed it."
    e "可我们杀了它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_221eecd8:

    # gg "The other one. We have two rune guardians."
    gg "是另一尊。我们有两尊符文守卫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_d819a6db:

    # e "W-what happened to them?"
    e "他、他们怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_df0f12a6:

    # gg "Our guardians went rogue after the primordial runes stopped supplying spell energy."
    gg "原初符文停止提供魔法能量后，我们的守卫就失控了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_5291daa2:

    # gg "They were summoned by Furkan's father with the basin, which went missing as well."
    gg "他们是弗坎的父亲用法盆召唤出来的，而法盆也不见了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_1adf0e00:

    # gg "And those guardians were supposed to be guarding the runes, right on top of our mountain."
    gg "那些守卫本来应该守护符文，就在我们山顶上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_ff505267:

    # goatguard "Uhmm... general, is it wise to share information to a Lusterfolk?"
    goatguard "呃……将军，向一个卢斯特菲尔德人透露这些信息，明智吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_cb46e8f1:

    # gg "No, but we need to save our chieftain."
    gg "不明智，但我们得救出酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_cfa1e194:

    # gg "He's in the cave."
    gg "他在洞穴里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kechioeren_Enter_Artifact_d759c583:

    # e "W-what Cave?"
    e "什、什么洞穴？"

