translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Trusty_10eebe0b:

    # e "Well, I'll do my best to continue making a good impression."
    e "嗯，我会尽力继续给人留下好印象。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Trusty_623be4f3:

    # "You wait a couple seconds, unsure on whether or not you should give Kari advice or not. Eventually, you cave into your need to be helpful."
    "你等了几秒，不确定该不该给卡里提建议。最终，你还是屈服于那股想帮忙的冲动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Trusty_b795fde6:

    # e "Regarding Furkan... I think it might be good for you to try and talk to him about how you've been feeling."
    e "说到弗坎……我觉得你或许可以试着和他谈谈你的感受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Trusty_b7880290:

    # "There are a few moments where it looks like Kari is going to yell at you for making a recommendation like that, but..."
    "有那么几刻，卡里看起来像是要因为你提出这种建议而冲你大喊，可是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Trusty_71700a04:

    # "Instead, Kari gives you a nod."
    "然而，卡里只是朝你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Trusty_32a8e5ce:

    # k "I think I just might."
    k "我想我会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Trusty_de6f7ca3:

    # k "You're free to go. Make sure to stay out of trouble."
    k "你可以走了。记得别惹麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Trusty_05f44d45:

    # "You roll your eyes."
    "你翻了个白眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Trusty_1fc00be2:

    # e "I will."
    e "我会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_f57dc55c:

    # "The General leads you to the path towards the cave, you follow his direction and walks across the forest."
    "将军带你走上通往山洞的小路，你跟着他的指引穿过森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_8b0b3bc3:

    # "You stare at the General, he seems so mysterious under the mask of his."
    "你注视着将军，面具下的他显得十分神秘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_c414462a:

    # gg "Over there."
    gg "那边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_4bbb4071:

    # "You are still not used to his young voice, but the mysterious general doesn't bother to utter a word."
    "你仍未习惯他年轻的声音，但这位神秘的将军似乎并不打算开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_d695b83e:

    # "So, you decide to strike a conversation."
    "于是，你决定主动搭话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_405b9b9e:

    # e "Hey, General, Can I ask your name?"
    e "喂，将军，我能问问你的名字吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_9d24105f:

    # gg "W-what?"
    gg "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_0842ba3c:

    # e "U-hm... your name?"
    e "呃……你的名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_ee5c3564:

    # k "Kari."
    k "卡里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_52993db8:

    # e "That's an unusual name."
    e "真是个少见的名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_41a56884:

    # k "Furkan's dad gave me this name."
    k "弗坎的父亲给我取了这个名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_ff88d578:

    # e "You seemed like a mage, or shaman."
    e "你看起来像法师，或者祭司。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_0d2fd413:

    # k "It's a long story. His father, Tevfik... he was a great man."
    k "说来话长。他的父亲，泰夫菲克……是个伟大的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_b1c71fe6:

    # k "And he had always wanted me to be the protector of the tribe."
    k "而且，他一直希望我能成为部族的守护者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_c84fe3ed:

    # e "You two are not related?"
    e "你们不是亲戚？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_d42dc7c1:

    # k "No, but I've been with the family since I have my first memory."
    k "不是，但我从记事起就是这个家的一员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_f09e02ff:

    # k "Now... that Furkan's brother and father's gone. I don't want to lose him too."
    k "如今……弗坎的兄弟和父亲都不在了。我也不想再失去他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_137c64cf:

    # e "Hey, I think Furkan will be alright."
    e "嘿，我觉得弗坎会没事的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_a01e5023:

    # "Kari turns and stares at you, you feel very uneasy seeing him under the eerie mask."
    "卡里转过身盯着你；看着诡异面具下的他，你感到十分不安。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_2752b772:

    # k "What about you?"
    k "那你呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_9732ea9d:

    # e "Me...?"
    e "我……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_4bc4b2e5:

    # k "Hmm?"
    k "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_0af55a1b:

    # e "I uhh... come from another place. You know about that, right?"
    e "呃……我来自另一个地方。你知道这件事，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_81762b7a:

    # k "Yeah, Puro. Furkan told me that."
    k "嗯，普罗。弗坎告诉过我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_0a463124:

    # e "Do you know anything about Chime?"
    e "你知道齐门的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_92346ecf:

    # k "No, but I've heard his name."
    k "不认识，不过听说过他的名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_22d8148b:

    # k "Nothing I can tell you about where he's gone, but I'd still like to know what's the deal with you."
    k "关于他去了哪里，我没什么能告诉你的。不过，我还是想知道你到底是怎么回事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_f272b11d:

    # e "He's my best friend, we've been together since I have any memories of existence."
    e "他是我最好的朋友，从我有记忆起，我们就一直在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_9c0aa805:

    # e "I've never felt a single moment we had separated, not until he just disappeared one day."
    e "在他有一天突然消失之前，我从未觉得我们有哪怕一刻分开过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_33cd8fec:

    # e "That was the first time I hadn't seen him, he was always smily, cheerful. And I felt lost without him."
    e "那是我第一次见不到他。他一直都笑容满面、充满活力。没有他，我感觉自己茫然无措。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_bbdeacbf:

    # e "So... I left the tribe, just to look for him. I searched around places where he used to hang out with me."
    e "所以……我离开了部落，只为寻找他。我在那些他过去常和我一起待过的地方四处寻找。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_c6a98938:

    # e "But I found nothing."
    e "但我什么也没找到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_0af40f6d:

    # k "What happened after?"
    k "后来发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_e4e76482:

    # e "Well. I stumbled upon some masked guy, and he was speaking gibberish. All I remembered was that he cast a blue... spell."
    e "嗯。我偶然遇到了一个戴面具的家伙，他嘴里说着胡言乱语。我只记得他施放了一道蓝色……法术。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_233fc561:

    # e "And I woke up here."
    e "然后我就在这里醒来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_193697fd:

    # k "What about the other folks? Do they know...?"
    k "那其他人呢？他们知道……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_dcb2f5c3:

    # e "O-other folks?"
    e "其、其他人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_cb956a27:

    # k "Tribesmen."
    k "部落里的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_3d2883bb:

    # e "I-I'm not sure. Now that I think of it, my memory has been really blurry since I woke up in this place."
    e "我、我不太确定。现在想想，自从在这里醒来后，我的记忆一直都很模糊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_59e48a69:

    # e "I can't remember anything concrete ever since, but I can still remember everything that happened right here."
    e "从那以后，我什么具体的事情都想不起来了，但在这里发生的一切我还是记得清清楚楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_3314395c:

    # k "You are weird."
    k "你很奇怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_4bb3a3a2:

    # e "Uh... thank you?"
    e "呃……谢谢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_a7d21717:

    # "You two continue to walk down the trail, sometimes the general awkwardly stares at you as you glance back."
    "你们俩继续沿着小路往前走。你回头看时，卡里有时会尴尬地盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_3c73f2f7:

    # "He averts his gaze quickly."
    "他很快移开了视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_bb05c3d3:

    # k "I suppose you understand where I'm coming from."
    k "我想，你应该明白我的意思了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_6b46ec42:

    # e "Sorry?"
    e "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_4e407a7d:

    # k "Searching for my chief."
    k "我在找我的族长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_70179041:

    # e "Oh... you two have been best friends also, right?"
    e "哦……你们两个也是最好的朋友，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_c22b121b:

    # k "Yes, I find it baffling how much similar our stories are."
    k "是啊，我也觉得我们的经历相似得令人难以置信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_06c1b643:

    # e "... At least I didn't end up becoming a general."
    e "……至少我最后没有当上将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_09cea9fd:

    # "Kari stares at you, his unintentional pout causes you to laugh."
    "卡里盯着你看，他无意间撅起嘴的样子让你笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_44c76fe1:

    # k "What are you laughing at?"
    k "你笑什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_376d2dc7:

    # e "N-nothing."
    e "没、没什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_3d3958b6:

    # "His pout gets bigger."
    "他撅起的嘴更明显了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_23332a04:

    # k "Well, Furkan can handle himself better than your Chime, also."
    k "嗯，弗坎也比你的齐门更能照顾好自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_35675f62:

    # e "Huh...?"
    e "啊……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_528aca2d:

    # k "He is as strong as his father. I trust he'll be safe."
    k "他和他父亲一样强壮。我相信他会平安无事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_d3833fa5:

    # k "But your friend, I can't speak for him."
    k "但你的朋友嘛，我就说不准了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_f05300f3:

    # "The general remains silent, he picks up his pace and you're falling behind of him."
    "将军一言不发，加快了脚步，你渐渐落在了他的后面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_3d9f89c9:

    # "It continues for a while until you are bored of the silence."
    "你们就这样走了一阵，直到你厌倦了沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_540225b9:

    # "You walk a little faster to catch up with him."
    "你加快了些脚步，追上他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_6b90839e:

    # e "You know what you reminded me of?"
    e "你知道你让我想起了谁吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_ddbc5ca2:

    # k "W-what?"
    k "谁、谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_07d940a5:

    # e "That monster, with the cape."
    e "那个披着斗篷的怪物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_befdd647:

    # k "I've told you already, I'm not wearing a cape."
    k "我已经告诉过你了，我没穿斗篷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_3584f8d1:

    # e "Alright, but you both have antlers, a scepter. and the X-shaped strap around you..."
    e "好吧，但你们两个都有鹿角、权杖，还有身上那条交叉形束带……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_0bf8eb44:

    # e "You know he brought me to this place, maybe for some sick reason, right?"
    e "你知道，是他把我带到这里来的，说不定是出于某种恶心的理由，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_31fb7d23:

    # k "Look, I told you, I don't walk in the dark trying to kidnap some savages into our tribe."
    k "听着，我已经说过了，我不会在黑暗中到处走，就为了把几个野人绑架进我们的部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_b910416c:

    # e "Alright... I thought so..."
    e "好吧……我就猜是这样……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_9b005be7:

    # e "So... what's under your mask?"
    e "那么……你的面具下面是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_ddbc5ca2_1:

    # k "W-what?"
    k "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_ecfb288d:

    # e "Can you put down your mask?"
    e "你能把面具摘下来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_7c2bde7e:

    # k "Why?"
    k "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_c926b024:

    # e "Cause... uhh... I'm curious?"
    e "因为……呃……我只是好奇？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_a03b677d:

    # "Kari takes off his mask for a second, before putting it back on."
    "卡里摘下面具片刻，又重新戴了回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_024ef151:

    # "The face behind his mask is a surprisingly young face, with a cleanly kept beard on his chin."
    "面具后的脸庞年轻得出人意料，下巴上的胡子修剪得干净利落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_ae3d1075:

    # e "You... look cute."
    e "你……看起来挺可爱的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_b7ee8f63:

    # k "Fuck you."
    k "去你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_f838afe9:

    # e "Can you put it down one more time so I can see more clearly."
    e "你能再摘一次吗？这样我能看得更清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_3426a587:

    # k "I know what you're doing, [e]."
    k "我知道你在打什么主意，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_5f76e41e:

    # k "And don't let me see you looking at me that way again."
    k "别让我再看到你用那种眼神看我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_6ca2f432:

    # e "Al-alright..."
    e "好、好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_ccada736:

    # e "What's the relationship between you and the chief?"
    e "你和酋长是什么关系？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_8c5c38bc:

    # k "Furk? I've been with him since the day I had memory."
    k "弗坎？我从记事起就一直和他在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_edd73060:

    # k "He, he's like a brother to me."
    k "他、他对我来说就像亲兄弟一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_6970e002:

    # e "Hmm... just brother?"
    e "嗯……只是兄弟？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_ddbc5ca2_2:

    # k "W-what?"
    k "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_d3c1de01:

    # k "Look, he's my friend and we've been through a lot."
    k "他是我的朋友，我们一起经历过很多事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_4ea96cc7:

    # e "I mean... do you two...share the bed?"
    e "我是说……你们两个……会睡在一张床上吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_4217208f:

    # k "w-what no. Why would I want to get into bed with another man."
    k "什、什么？不，当然不会。我为什么要和另一个男人上床？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_b8662407:

    # k "w-hat?"
    k "看什么看？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_7e5be565:

    # e "What?"
    e "啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_5aeb1edb:

    # k "No. I wouldn't. and I shouldn't... but... n-nooo."
    k "不，我不会。而且我也不该……可是……不、不行——"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_efcc792f:

    # "Kari continues shaking his head, muttering something under his breath."
    "卡里继续摇着头，低声嘟囔着什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_334e60b1:

    # "You decide to let him be with his thought for a while."
    "你决定先让他独自沉浸在自己的思绪里一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_a7092e0a:

    # "You and Kari reached the Lagoon, he motions you to drink from it to heal yourself."
    "你和卡里抵达了湖泊，他示意你喝些湖水来疗伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_797c0ccb:

    # k "Drink?"
    k "喝？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_e53c6fed:

    # e "Alright..."
    e "好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_c1bbe4c5:

    # "You drink from the lagoon and feel instantly revitatlised."
    "你喝下湖水，立刻感觉恢复了精神。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_8bb248f7:

    # e "I... don't have a bucket."
    e "我……没有水桶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_d55918f6:

    # k "Alright, courier..."
    k "好吧，信使……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_095cae1e:

    # "The general takes out his woodle bottle and scoop up some water before handing it to you."
    "将军拿出他的木制水瓶，舀起一些水后递给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_0804d8bb:

    # e "Can you help me?"
    e "你能帮我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_50c31736:

    # k "Why are you like this."
    k "你为什么非得这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_33532784:

    # e "I don't know, maybe because I just lost a battle."
    e "我不知道，可能是因为我刚输掉了一场战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_45335297:

    # k "Whatever. Open your mouth."
    k "算了。张嘴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_bd11123f:

    # "He slowly pours the water into your mouth, you can smell his sweating palm holding the bottle."
    "他缓缓把水倒进你嘴里，你还能闻到他握着水瓶的手掌上的汗味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_34f010a7:

    # "You stick your tongue out and lick his finger. He instantly gets startled and drops his bottle on your face."
    "你伸出舌头舔了舔他的手指。他立刻受惊，手一松，水瓶砸在了你的脸上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_8d68e49b:

    # e "Ouch..."
    e "好痛……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_d4c5e83d:

    # k "What touched me..."
    k "什么碰到我了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_243016fb:

    # e "My tongue?"
    e "我的舌头？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_55baca04:

    # k "W-what? Why. Why would you do that."
    k "什——什么？为什么？你为什么要这么做？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_dac5de8c:

    # e "Sorry, just wanted to taste you."
    e "抱歉，我只是想尝尝你的味道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_b7ee8f63_1:

    # k "Fuck you."
    k "操你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_5897b7ce:

    # e "Alright. I'm sorry, can you help me, please?"
    e "好啦，对不起。可以请你帮我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_a5462bb4:

    # k "No, no. take my bottle and drink it yourself."
    k "不，不行。拿我的水瓶，自己喝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_72a33094_1:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_c0523535:

    # "You drink a few bottle of it and feel instantly revitalised."
    "你喝了几瓶水，立刻感觉恢复了精神。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_25e90c62:

    # "Kari waits for you to stand up and continue on your journey."
    "卡里等着你站起身，继续你的旅程。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_ff1f58ea:

    # "After a while, you feel like you should chat with Kari again."
    "过了一会儿，你觉得该再和卡里聊聊了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_e2b9a76f:

    # e "This, this forest, it's pretty nice to walk, right?"
    e "这、这片森林走起来挺舒服的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_bf832a13:

    # k "No."
    k "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_8f90b8ec:

    # e "Al-alright."
    e "好、好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_bd819583:

    # k "I liked it but my antler often gets stuck in the branches..."
    k "我觉得还不错，可我的角经常会卡在树枝间……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_95b1395d:

    # e "W-wait, really?"
    e "等、等等，真的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_b06df41b:

    # "You chuckles a bit from his unfortune, he doesn't seem to mind, though."
    "你因他的不幸轻轻笑了几声，不过他似乎并不介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_6468e48d:

    # k "You're lucky that your horn isn't forked."
    k "你的角没有分叉，真幸运。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_e82980cf:

    # e "Yeah, I feel very lucky now."
    e "是啊，我现在觉得自己真幸运。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_bfea543f:

    # e "So, how did you become a general in the tribe?"
    e "那么，你是怎么成为部落将军的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_ddbc5ca2_3:

    # k "W-what?"
    k "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_982535f0:

    # k "One day Tevfik, Furkan's father just told me."
    k "有一天，泰夫菲克，也就是弗坎的父亲，直接告诉了我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_bfc8979a:

    # k "Hmm... that I should protect the tribe for him when he's gone."
    k "嗯……他说，等他不在了，让我替他保护部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_b49fea37:

    # e "O-oh."
    e "哦、哦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_cea34a4f:

    # k "So, there's that."
    k "就是这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_19fae5c5:

    # e "I see."
    e "我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_077f005e:

    # e "What's your tribe like?"
    e "你们部落是什么样的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_ddbc5ca2_4:

    # k "W-what?"
    k "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_405ab4d3:

    # e "Do you people believe in any?"
    e "你们有什么信仰吗……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_888073a0:

    # k "We did. The god of intelligence, Tapjoo. Like any other Tribes."
    k "我们有。智慧之神闼丕瓯，就和其他部落一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_aaa657f3:

    # k "We didn't have a huge belief and ritual after, Tevfik, Furkan's father is gone."
    k "自从泰夫菲克，也就是弗坎的父亲，离世后，我们就没有再举行过什么盛大的信仰仪式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_787a7122:

    # k "Furkan is handling everything well, even without worshipping our god."
    k "即使不再信仰我们的神，弗坎也把一切处理得很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_5c4d7933:

    # k "I believe in him."
    k "我相信他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_52355c6e:

    # e "Alright, that's... good to know."
    e "好吧，这……知道这些挺好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_fd8d5ecc:

    # e "(I should probably stay silent for now.)"
    e "（我现在还是少说为妙。）"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_9b5bb3ec:

    # "At last, you and Kari reach the cave. It seems almost dark, luckily Kari stands beside you."
    "终于，你和卡里来到了洞穴。里面几乎一片漆黑，好在卡里就在你身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_8c0cbb7c:

    # "He is way taller than you, not mentioning his antler sticking out of his head."
    "他比你高出太多了，更别提头上还支棱着一根鹿角。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_102e3efa:

    # "You try to grasp into his hand for comfort but he instantly flinches."
    "你想握住他的手寻求安慰，可他立刻瑟缩了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_30fa8481:

    # k "What are you doing?"
    k "你在干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_965e542a:

    # e "Uhmmm, sorry, I was a little scared."
    e "呃……抱歉，我刚才有点害怕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_4bdf677e:

    # "The general holds onto your arm for a moment, his palm is very warm, it almost melts your heart with his little actions."
    "将军握住你的手臂片刻，他的掌心十分温暖，这些细微的举动几乎让你的心都融化了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_0f16cedf:

    # k "Stay Alert, courier."
    k "保持警惕，信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_1745fa0f:

    # e "I will, Kari."
    e "我会的，卡里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_60648222:

    # k "Call me General."
    k "叫我将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Adventure_268188c5:

    # e "Alright... General."
    e "好吧……将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_0e69ad46:

    # "You stroll around the forest aimlessly, there's probably nothing interesting in the area anyway. It's almost getting exhausting exploring the endless forest."
    "你漫无目的地在森林里闲逛，反正这片区域大概也没什么有趣的东西。探索这片无边无际的森林，已经让你感到有些疲惫了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_c5205af5:

    # "In the middle of your own reflection, you detect a weird bell ringing sound from afar. You look around and scratch your head, confused for not making out the source of the noise."
    "在沉思之际，你从远处听到一阵古怪的铃声。你环顾四周，困惑地挠了挠头，怎么也找不到声音的来源。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_ea38a4db:

    # "A shooting sound turns you from frustration to horror, You don't know where the sound comes from. You only know that you life is in danger if you stay in place for one more second."
    "一声射击般的破空声让你从烦躁转为恐惧。你不知道声音来自何处，只知道如果再在原地多待一秒，你的性命就会有危险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_70bd80ed:

    # "'SWOOOOF' An arrow blasts just in front of you, hitting the tree right beside you, embedded deep within the center of the tree."
    "“嗖——”一支箭从你正前方呼啸而过，射中旁边的大树，深深嵌入树干中央。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_69e760f4:

    # "You are sure that you would have been instantly shot in the head if you stand 1 inch further, your body freezes from shock, not knowing what to do."
    "你确信只要再往前站一英寸，就会当场被一箭射中脑袋。你因震惊而浑身僵住，不知该如何是好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_a7948122:

    # "The bell ringing is getting louder and louder with each seconds passing, you are completely stunned looking at the arrow, unaware of the mysterious figure approaching you."
    "随着时间一秒秒过去，铃声越来越响。你完全被眼前的箭惊呆了，丝毫没有察觉那个神秘身影正朝你走来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_9163dd5f:

    # my "Who are you. You are not from our tribe, are you?"
    my "你是谁？你不是我们部族的人，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_fdb07aee:

    # "You still can't move your head away from the arrow that could have killed you, it makes you at least ignore the fact that someone is aiming their bow at you, ready to release it."
    "你依旧无法把头从那支险些要了你命的箭旁移开，这至少让你忽略了有人正张弓瞄准着你，随时准备松弦放箭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_6a3ed3f2:

    # e "Uh, Can you put your weapon down...?"
    e "呃，你能把武器放下吗……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_150f2955:

    # my "I can kill you here right now. Last chance. Who are you?"
    my "我现在就能在这里杀了你。这是你最后的机会。你是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_0cb9d1e7:

    # "You turn around, and see a ram right in front of you. He is probably not joking around. You stare at his bow, panicked. He's pulling his bow further now."
    "你转过身，看见一头公羊正站在你面前。他显然不是在开玩笑。你惊慌地盯着他的弓，而他此刻又把弓弦拉得更开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_11f9bacb:

    # e "I- uhh... I'm [e]."
    e "我——呃……我叫[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_c031e0d4:

    # my "Where are you from."
    my "你从哪里来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_62159bf5:

    # e "I am from Puro, uhhh... I live in Lusterfield now."
    e "我来自普罗，呃……我现在住在卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_c18a18fa:

    # my "The village?"
    my "村子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_74db1a7f:

    # e "Yes..."
    e "是的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_45505039:

    # "You notice the ram is slightly lowering his bow now, but still he doesn't let go, instead he asks you another question."
    "你注意到那只公羊此刻稍稍放低了弓，但仍未松手，反而又问了你一个问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_173c5536:

    # my "Why are you here?"
    my "你为什么来这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_6638345c:

    # e "I'm out adventuring."
    e "我出来冒险的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_cf97e9a7:

    # my "You know about the ritual, do you not?"
    my "你知道那个仪式，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_84e218a7:

    # e "U-uh? Look I don't know who you are. Just let me go and you'll not see me here again."
    e "呃、呃？听着，我不知道你是谁。放我走，你以后就不会再在这里见到我了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_c0ae43f5:

    # my "I need to talk to your chief."
    my "我要和你们的首领谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_943c3c4d:

    # e "Uhh... who?"
    e "呃……谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_d0ccc550:

    # my "The Bull, Rahim. I have something to discuss with him."
    my "那头公牛，雷希姆。我有事要和他谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_b39357d8:

    # e "Alright... Can you lower your weapon now?"
    e "好吧……现在可以把武器放下了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_59256155:

    # "You see the figure rest his bow, putting away his arrows. You breath a sigh of relief, at least you made it out alive."
    "你看着那人放下弓，收起箭矢。你松了口气，至少你活着出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_a626f768:

    # my "I'm Furkan. Chieftain of the Goat Tribe."
    my "我是弗坎，山羊部落的首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_39c4c2b0:

    # e "Hmmm... I thought you are a ram?"
    e "嗯……我还以为你是公羊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_aefd8172:

    # f "It's the same."
    f "一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_28ad4ae1:

    # e "Alright. Nice to meet you... I guess."
    e "好吧。见到你很高兴……大概吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_bfd4a8e8:

    # f "Look, I need someone I can trust to deliver an important letter to Rahim. It's about our people, I think it's time for us to break the ice."
    f "听着，我需要一个值得信任的人把一封重要的信送给雷希姆。信是关于我们两族的，我想，我们也该打破僵局了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_9e42fff2:

    # e "Hmm... Why don't you just go to the village yourself?"
    e "嗯……你为什么不自己去村子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_bda72887:

    # f "I can't. That wolf asshole will hunt me down as soon as he sees me. And I don't want to unnecessarily kill anyone. It's just a letter of peace."
    f "我不能。那头混账狼一见到我就会追杀我。而且我不想无谓地杀人。这只是一封和平信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_36fda691:

    # e "So... it's a Truce."
    e "所以……这是停战协议。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_52ffac59:

    # f "A reconciliation. I suppose."
    f "应该算是和解吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_3cc49d8d:

    # e "You can give me the letter, I'll just take it to Rahim and let you know how it goes."
    e "你可以把信交给我，我会把它带给雷希姆，再告诉你结果如何。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_73691eea:

    # "Furkan hesitantly take out the letter from his loincloth, he ponders for a second, probably wondering whether you are to be trusted."
    "弗坎迟疑地从缠腰布里取出信件，思索了片刻，大概是在考虑你是否值得信任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_65c6723e:

    # "Eventually he puts away the letter, staring at you instead."
    "最终，他收起信件，转而盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_31dbfce2:

    # f "How do I know I can trust you. Are you a courier?"
    f "我怎么知道自己能信任你？你是信使吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_9b90deac:

    # e "I have my courier badge here, look. I will abide by the rules of courier."
    e "我把信使徽章带在身上，你看。我会遵守信使的规矩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_30d81586:

    # f "Hmm... But how can I trust you?"
    f "嗯……可我怎么相信你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_f962a80f:

    # e "I don't know."
    e "我不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_7a33a637:

    # f "I see. Take the letter. Deliver to Rahim. His eyes only."
    f "明白了。拿着这封信，送给雷希姆。只能由他亲启。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_314362f7:

    # e "Wait... Why are you suddenly trusting me now."
    e "等等……你为什么突然就相信我了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_4ecda854:

    # f "I don't think you are lying, and I know who made the badge."
    f "我觉得你没撒谎，而且我知道这枚徽章是谁做的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_a1040e32:

    # e "Hmm... alright, I guess. I'll take it to Rahim."
    e "嗯……好吧，算了。我会把它送给雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_43d07cc3:

    # f "You know where to find me."
    f "你知道去哪儿找我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_8b871255:

    # e "Alright... I'll take off now... See you Furkan."
    e "好吧……我这就走……再见，弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_6e7e5691:

    # e "I am not the courier... yet."
    e "我还不是信使……至少现在不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_8c3907b5:

    # f "Hmm..."
    f "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_ffe0248d:

    # f "Would you become a courier later or would you find someone else?"
    f "你以后会成为信使，还是会去找别人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_c1276890:

    # e "I'll be right back and I'll show you a proof of being a courier."
    e "我马上就回来，也会给你看我身为信使的证明。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_First_Meet_038b3ad2:

    # f "I suppose so. You know where to find me."
    f "我想是吧。你知道去哪儿找我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_d9093596:

    # "You walk into Furkan's hut. The general and the chieftain are discussing as usual."
    "你走进弗坎的住处。将军和酋长像往常一样正在交谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_747a0649:

    # "But upon another look, it seems more clear that it wasn't just some discussion."
    "但再仔细一看，事情似乎明显不只是普通的交谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_65c7ecd3:

    # k "What do you mean, Furkan. You already kno-"
    k "你这是什么意思，弗坎？你已经知——"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_35ecda47:

    # "The general pauses as he notices your presence. Both of them turn to you with a face of surprise."
    "将军注意到你的存在，停了下来。两人都面露惊讶，转身看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_a6be8290:

    # k "Mert! Come escort the courier out."
    k "梅尔特！过来把这个信使带出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_f7c044ff:

    # goatguard "Yes, general."
    goatguard "是，将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_d3535d40:

    # e "S-sorry, I'll be gone in a second."
    e "对、对不起，我马上就走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_59e29a1a:

    # "You awkwardly smile as a guard flips open the curtain from behind you."
    "你尴尬地笑了笑，一名守卫从你身后掀开帘子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_f472349f:

    # "He grapples onto your arm, which causes you to flinch instinctively."
    "他一把抓住你的手臂，你本能地瑟缩了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_788dc2d5:

    # f "No, guard. Let him stay, he is trusted."
    f "不，守卫。让他留下，他是可信的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_cf7898f4:

    # "Kari furrows his brows under the mask, but he remains silent as Furkan gives him a side glance."
    "卡里在面具下皱起眉头，但弗坎朝他侧目一瞥时，他仍然一言不发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_3464364a:

    # "And without another word, the guard leaves the room almost immediately, as if he also knows the gravity of the situation."
    "没再多说一句，守卫便几乎立刻离开了房间，仿佛他也知道事态的严重性。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_dc60bc50:

    # "You can sense an aura of uneasiness emanating within this room, an unspoken aggression between the chieftain and the general."
    "你能感受到房间里弥漫着一股不安的气息，酋长与将军之间涌动着不曾言明的敌意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_7b33d9dd:

    # f "Come, take a seat, [e]."
    f "来，坐吧，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_23634915:

    # e "Uhmm... You sure that's fine? We can always talk later."
    e "呃……你确定这样没问题吗？我们随时都可以改天再谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_3ac79564:

    # f "Yes, I am sure."
    f "我确定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_c4ad1225:

    # "...And you're sure the tension raises tenfold as you sit across the table where Kari is standing, still silent."
    "……而你在卡里仍默不作声地站在桌子另一边坐下时，紧张感顿时增加了十倍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_06875f72:

    # "In fact, the room has been nothing but silence for a few seconds before Furkan speaks."
    "事实上，在弗坎开口前，房间里已经沉默了好几秒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_f1863f3e:

    # f "It has been a while since we last talked to Lusterfield, and we're thinking, if there is a possibility of reconciliation, a solution to the problem of both of us."
    f "我们已经有一阵子没和卢斯特菲尔德交谈了。我们在想，是否有可能与他们和解，解决我们双方的问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_d64ce8b3:

    # f "Our primordial runes remains stolen, and we need a trusted ally that can help us fight this unknown entity."
    f "我们的原初符文还被人偷走了，我们需要一个值得信赖的盟友，来帮助我们对抗这个未知的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_e7c3c041:

    # e "How would this help Lusterfield in any way?"
    e "这对卢斯特菲尔德有什么帮助？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_cdbc2098:

    # f "Monsters are arriving from every corner of the world, ever since everything that happened."
    f "自那一切发生之后，怪物便从世界各处纷纷涌来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_11c14426:

    # f "We should combine our force, lest when the threat finally knocks on our door, we should stand together."
    f "我们应该 объедин合力量，以免威胁最终找上门时，我们只能各自为战。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_147095b6:

    # e "So, what's the threat exactly."
    e "所以，威胁究竟是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_c681a7ac:

    # f "We don't know yet. It could be anyone who's powerful enough, it could be a tribe, like the bears from the far north."
    f "我们还不知道。可能是任何足够强大的存在，也可能是某个部族，比如来自遥远北方的熊族。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_a3118740:

    # "You glance at Kari, and he looks away."
    "你看了卡里一眼，而他移开了视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_087ff10a:

    # e "Uhm, general, what do you think?"
    e "呃，将军，你怎么看？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_f4d42c0d:

    # k "You're not listening."
    k "你根本没在听。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_64346512:

    # "The general is directly addressing Furkan, who sits on the chair, stoic to a disgruntled general."
    "将军正直截了当地对弗坎说话，而弗坎坐在椅子上，面对恼怒的将军依旧面无表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_f9029c9d:

    # f "I listened, and I said no, with respect."
    f "我听见了，也已经表示拒绝，恕我直言。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_8a5c51aa:

    # k "I trust your judgement, Furk. But you can't keep repeating the same mistake."
    k "我信任你的判断，弗坎。但你不能一再犯同样的错误。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_3d5d3219:

    # k "The old bull has already made up his mind, nothing can change that."
    k "那头老公牛早已打定了主意，什么也改变不了这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_84f284d0:

    # f "Why are you so certain?"
    f "你为什么如此肯定？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_76eb606d:

    # k "Because we've already done that?"
    k "因为我们已经做过那种事了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_ab49a62a:

    # k "Tevfik died for this, and you're suggesting things can go back to what it really was?"
    k "特夫菲克为此而死，而你却认为一切还能回到原来的样子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_4b4fbc97:

    # f "Don't you bring my father into this conversation."
    f "你别把我父亲扯进这场谈话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_caaefa36:

    # f "Tevfik died for us. You are not the one to speak on his behalf, like you did not send him on his path of destruction."
    f "特夫菲克为我们而死。你没资格替他说话，就好像不是你把他送上毁灭之路一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_8409c795:

    # f "You were his advisor, Kari."
    f "你曾是他的顾问，卡里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_0ca52f6b:

    # k "What are you talking about?"
    k "你在说什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_103c26bf:

    # k "I was not the one that left us all alone when the tribe needs help the most, he thought you were gone for good."
    k "部落最需要帮助的时候，不是我把我们所有人丢下不管的——他以为你再也不会回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_935b2fb1:

    # k "Did you know how that destroyed him while I was watching there?"
    k "你知道我眼睁睁看着那件事如何摧毁他的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_4fd65bf8:

    # k "Every night, I can swear I hear him cr-"
    k "每晚我都敢发誓，自己听见他在哭-"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_6b9e720a:

    # "Kari stops abruptly, he stares back at you again."
    "卡里突然停下，又回头盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_9484a29c:

    # f "Keep going."
    f "继续说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_a6f29581:

    # k "I don't think that's necessary."
    k "我觉得没这个必要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_d29f5f84:

    # f "If you wanted to tear another hole in my heart, then do it now."
    f "如果你还想在我心上再撕开一道伤口，那现在就动手吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_66407530:

    # k "That was not my intention."
    k "我不是这个意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_4a23462f:

    # f "Was it not?"
    f "真的不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_8bb8627e:

    # k "You know I'd never mean it like that-"
    k "你知道我绝不是那个意思-"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_0bd46bf2:

    # k "I-"
    k "我——"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_26879c20:

    # "Both of them look away from each other."
    "两人都别开脸，不再看对方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_395ccb6b:

    # k "I apologise for my language, a general should not speak to his chief like this."
    k "我为刚才的言辞道歉，将军不该这样对酋长说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_e2a70bbb:

    # "He exclaims, looking at both of you."
    "他看着你们两人喊道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_23339968:

    # k "I'll excuse myself."
    k "我先告退。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_5d1428b2:

    # "Kari walks off with uncertainty, as Furkan stares."
    "卡里带着迟疑走开，弗坎凝视着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_34570ee8:

    # "The chieftain looks down and takes a deep breath."
    "酋长低下头，深深吸了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_6ef35025:

    # f "Kari."
    f "卡里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_610f8455:

    # "The general turns halfway towards the chieftain."
    "将军朝酋长转过半个身子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_4355a3a6:

    # f "I'm sorry."
    f "对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_c1306c2f:

    # "It's hard to see emotion under his mask, but the general eventually leaves without another word."
    "面具遮掩着他的表情，很难看出他的情绪，但将军最终一言不发地离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_b65e38a6:

    # "Moments of silence continues as sounds of Kari's footstep fades."
    "寂静持续了片刻，卡里的脚步声渐渐远去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_6fc36745:

    # "And now, it's just you and Furkan sitting across each other."
    "现在，只剩你和弗坎面对面坐着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_dc4bb565:

    # f "What do you think?"
    f "你怎么看？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_3cc66981:

    # "Furkan speaks as he elicit a faint smile."
    "弗坎说着，脸上浮现一丝淡淡的笑意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_6e0f4cff:

    # e "I'd say, go for it. Besides, I suppose you don't accept no as an answer."
    e "我会说，放手去做吧。再说，我猜你也不是那种听到“不”就会罢休的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_b44d2397:

    # f "Something else in your mind?"
    f "你还有别的想法？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_7150ce76:

    # e "I don't really mean to talk about who's right or wrong, but maybe listen more to Kari?"
    e "我不是想讨论谁对谁错，只是……也许你可以多听听卡里的意见？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_fb1ce775:

    # e "-And I know you've made up your mind. You make the final decision here."
    e "-我知道你已经拿定主意了。这里由你做最终决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_acd4b9cf:

    # f "Then what is the problem?"
    f "那问题在哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_3e435330:

    # e "He's been there, every time you need anything, and I can see the desperation in his eyes when you went missing."
    e "他一直都在，每当你需要什么时都会出现；你失踪时，我看得出他眼中的绝望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_c840bed8:

    # e "It's just, maybe it goes a long way to make Kari feel appreciated in the discussion."
    e "只是……在讨论时让卡里感受到自己的意见受到重视，或许会大有帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_d2587bac:

    # e "Either as your general, or... your friend."
    e "无论是作为你的将军，还是……朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_4939b13e:

    # f "Do not worry, courier. I am not angry at him."
    f "别担心，信使。我没有生他的气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_9c6c51da:

    # e "Nothing else, I think you're on the right path here."
    e "没别的了，我觉得你走在正确的路上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_9b4732bd:

    # e "Kari did suggest some troubles you might face, but I trust you'll prevail."
    e "卡里确实提到过你可能会遇到的一些麻烦，但我相信你会克服它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_f5ae68a5:

    # f "It seems a courier has more faith in my leadership than my general."
    f "看来一个信使比我的将军更相信我的领导能力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_4158bddd:

    # e "I just think that, Lusterfield's not looking for another war, so there's really nothing worse that can happen."
    e "我只是觉得，卢斯特菲尔德并不想再挑起一场战争，所以实在不会有什么更糟的事发生了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_74f570a1:

    # f "Hah, you are hilarious, [e]."
    f "哈，你真有意思，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_d5f25b19:

    # f "Either way, do not worry about Kari, I am not angry at him."
    f "无论如何，别担心卡里，我没有生他的气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_a4178f6d:

    # "Furkan speaks as he looks at the shifting curtains, but it was just wind."
    "弗坎一边说，一边看向晃动的帘子，但那只是风吹的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_28070c5a:

    # f "We are caught between a rock and a hard place here, and as protectors of the tribe, we cannot let personal emotions get in the way of what is best for the tribe."
    f "我们现在进退两难，而作为部落的守护者，不能让个人情感妨碍对部落最有利的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_8741c15a:

    # f "I am sure Kari will soon come to understand."
    f "我相信卡里很快就会理解的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_0bf91209:

    # f "You should go now, do not let me bother you any further."
    f "你现在该走了，别再让我打扰你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_3d802b34:

    # e "I-it's ok."
    e "没、没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_e74033f8:

    # f "Guard!"
    f "卫兵！"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_0692ac02:

    # "The chieftain shouts, as a guard at the door arrives."
    "酋长喊道，这时门口的守卫走了进来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_9e690bb9:

    # f "Please escort [e] outside. Make sure he is pampered and well."
    f "请护送[e]出去。务必好好款待他，照顾周全。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_fe0923b9:

    # goatguard "Yes, chief."
    goatguard "是，酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_5941ea84:

    # f "Thank you, Hakki."
    f "谢谢你，哈基。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_8ab5a3ff:

    # goatguard "It's Mer-"
    goatguard "是梅尔——"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_f8224250:

    # "The guard stops midway through his sentence, before nervously leading you outside."
    "守卫话说到一半便停了下来，然后紧张地领你走了出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_497f83a7:

    # "Furkan smiles awkwardly towards both of you."
    "弗坎朝你们两人尴尬地笑了笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_ba2539b2:

    # "As you turn your head before the curtain closes, you notice Furkan rushing quickly towards the back of the hut."
    "在帘子合上前，你回过头，注意到弗坎正飞快地朝小屋后方跑去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_6dd61cfd:

    # "It seems fairly obvious Furkan is using you to make Kari nervous, despite how uncomfortable it makes both of you feel."
    "很明显，弗坎是在利用你让卡里紧张，尽管这让你们两人都感到不自在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_e3b20e03:

    # "But it's still surprising that he dismissed you this fast."
    "不过，他这么快就打发你走，还是令人意外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_1ac9a110:

    # "Maybe there's pent-up emotion after arguing about the former chief, underneath the smile he's putting up."
    "也许，在争论前任酋长一事后，他强撑的笑容下压抑着某种情绪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_54447f87:

    # "Or maybe he's brewing up another actual plan, you don't know what it is."
    "又或者，他正在酝酿另一个真正的计划，只是你不知道那是什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Before_Reconciliation_ecb2bdc3:

    # "You can only hope it's better for everyone involved."
    "你只能希望，这对所有相关的人来说会更好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_2cd10dc5:

    # f "We met again."
    f "又见面了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_43c5bf38:

    # "You found furkan sitting on a giant wooden log, he is chewing on some meat, with bones scattering on the ground."
    "你发现弗坎坐在一根巨大的原木上，嘴里嚼着肉，骨头散落在地上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_4ee6acae:

    # e "I brought you my badge, I'm the courier of Lusterfield now."
    e "我把徽章带来了，我现在是卢斯特菲尔德的信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_30d81586:

    # f "Hmm... But how can I trust you?"
    f "嗯……但我怎么能相信你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_f962a80f:

    # e "I don't know."
    e "我不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_2d81ade4:

    # f "I see."
    f "我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_8023a321:

    # f "Take the letter. Deliver to Rahim. His eyes only."
    f "拿上这封信。交给雷希姆。只准他本人亲阅。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_314362f7:

    # e "Wait... Why are you suddenly trusting me now."
    e "等等……你为什么突然相信我了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_4ecda854:

    # f "I don't think you are lying, and I know who made the badge."
    f "我不认为你在撒谎，而且我知道这枚徽章是谁做的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_a1040e32:

    # e "Hmm... alright, I guess. I'll take it to Rahim."
    e "嗯……好吧，既然如此。我会把它交给雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_43d07cc3:

    # f "You know where to find me."
    f "你知道去哪儿找我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_939f7613:

    # e "Alright... I'll take off now. See you Furkan."
    e "好吧……我先走了。再见，弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_c145b90b:

    # e "Hey... I was just walking around. I am not the courier... yet."
    e "嘿……我只是四处逛逛。我还不是信使……至少现在还不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_8c3907b5:

    # f "Hmm..."
    f "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_ffe0248d:

    # f "Would you become a courier later or would you find someone else?"
    f "你以后会成为信使，还是会去找别人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_c1276890:

    # e "I'll be right back and I'll show you a proof of being a courier."
    e "我马上回来，给你看看我身为信使的证明。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_038b3ad2:

    # f "I suppose so. You know where to find me."
    f "我想是吧。你知道去哪儿找我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_2129529e:

    # e "Hey... Furkan. I've delivered the letter."
    e "嘿……弗坎。信我已经送到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_b839b844:

    # f "What did they say?"
    f "他怎么说？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_10cfe59f:

    # e "Uh... Rahim, he said... Duly Noted."
    e "呃……雷希姆说……“已知悉”。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_05f2db9b:

    # f "What does that mean? [e]?"
    f "这是什么意思？[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_6aa19a40:

    # e "I don't think he wanted to reconcile..."
    e "我觉得他不想和解……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_c9d164ca:

    # f "Really?"
    f "真的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_96c0af12:

    # "You notice a sign of frustration in Furkan's voice."
    "你从弗坎的声音中听出一丝沮丧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_b5d63560:

    # f "The battle had been ages, 4 years already, and the old bull still does not think it is enough."
    f "战争都已经过去很久了，整整四年，这头老牛却还是觉得不够。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_3830ea84:

    # f "It was not just his daughter. Did he not remember my father was lost to the war?"
    f "又不只是他的女儿。他难道忘了我的父亲也死于战争吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_fb23d394:

    # "The goat chief walks around aimlessly, continuing to whine under his breath."
    "羊族族长漫无目的地走来走去，继续低声嘟囔着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_6c08076c:

    # f "What was I thinking-"
    f "我当时在想什么——"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_7d83fbde:

    # f "I should not have tried. Not to have let him embarrass me like that."
    f "我就不该尝试。更不该让他那样羞辱我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_85de611a:

    # "He looks down for a few seconds, before turning to you, expecting a response."
    "他低下头几秒，随后转向你，等待你的回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_6b5d9316:

    # e "I think Rahim just wanted everything to stay as it is now."
    e "我想雷希姆只是想让一切维持现状。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_0cb668ec:

    # f "Of course he does."
    f "他当然会这么想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_208ddbc9:

    # "Furkan scoffs at you, and prepares to take off."
    "弗坎朝你冷哼一声，准备离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_503952ff:

    # e "Now that I helped you... can we talk about Ch-"
    e "既然我已经帮了你……我们能不能谈谈齐——"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_77171e80:

    # f "I will return to my Tribe now. No reason to stay. Everything else stays the same."
    f "我现在要回部族了。没理由继续待下去。其他一切都保持不变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_75ab91e4:

    # e "W-wait..."
    e "等、等等……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_12d52308:

    # e "You won't start a war over this... right?"
    e "你不会因为这件事……发动战争吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_257c3cc1:

    # f "No. Forget we ever have any such conversation. Do not come back, my people will not spare a courier."
    f "不。就当我们从未有过这样的谈话。别再回来，我的族人不会放过送信人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_47ff1c95:

    # "You stand on the grass, looking at the back of the ram as he walks away in disgruntled sigh. You probably won't see him here again."
    "你站在草地上，望着公羊伴着不满的叹息走远的背影。你大概不会再在这里见到他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_ed82a541:

    # e "Hey... Furkan. We met again."
    e "嘿……弗坎。我们又见面了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_48ad0470:

    # f "So, have you delivered the letter?"
    f "那么，信送到了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_6620057f:

    # e "Not yet... But I wanted to talk about oth-"
    e "还没……不过我想谈谈其——"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_26c05dc0:

    # f "We shall stay civil, we would talk when you deliver the letter."
    f "我们还是先客气些吧，等你把信送到后再谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Second_Meet_0c4241dc:

    # e "Hmm... Alright, thanks, Furkan."
    e "嗯……好吧，谢谢你，弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_f91157f7:

    # e "Furkan, I'm sorry about what happened at the temple."
    e "弗坎，神殿里发生的事，我很抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_58474f91:

    # f "I blame the cultists, not you, [e]. Never had I thought the cult were still alive and well. I thought they were mere myth."
    f "我怪的是那些邪教徒，不是你，[e]。我从没想过邪教竟然还存在，而且仍然活跃。我还以为那只是传说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_bb658d04:

    # e "What were those myths about? It's the first time I've heard of them."
    e "那些传说讲的是什么？这是我第一次听说它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_a9f15ae9:

    # f "They spoke of dark rituals, of sacrifices made to ancient gods, and of power that could bend the mind amongst our people."
    f "他们讲述黑暗仪式、献祭古神，以及一种能在我们族人之间扭曲心智的力量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_fe8da3b1:

    # f "As you may have guessed, those ancient gods, or the primordials, have forsaken the mortals long ago."
    f "你可能也猜到了，那些古老的神明，也就是原初神，早已抛弃凡人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_d541c090:

    # f "They left behind only traces of their power, and even that eroded with time."
    f "它们只留下了些许力量的痕迹，就连那些痕迹也随着时间流逝而逐渐消散。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_911ba677:

    # f "We have heard that some time ago, our tribe had stopped worshipping Tapjoo, our old god."
    f "我们听说，前些时候，我们部族已经停止崇拜塔普乔这位旧神。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_af92e8eb:

    # f "However, some of the elders, they still cling onto the old ways, believing that Tapjoo will return one day."
    f "然而，一些长老仍然固守着旧日的信仰，相信塔普乔终有一天会回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_df8eb94d:

    # f "These goats formed a secret coterie dedicated to the forest god, and they stole part of the power of the runes for themselves."
    f "这些山羊组成了一个秘密小团体，专门侍奉森林之神，还偷走了部分符文的力量据为己有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_2d4a7efa:

    # f "When the chieftain at the time found out, they were banished, and we never heard of them since."
    f "当时的酋长发现此事后，他们就被放逐了。从那以后，我们再也没听到过他们的消息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_05bdcf0a:

    # e "I see... so they are the ones who stole the runes?"
    e "我明白了……所以偷走符文的就是他们？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_58ac198b:

    # f "Yes, but what were these cultish goats planning to do with the runes?"
    f "是的，但这些邪教山羊打算用符文做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_352e3141:

    # e "Furkan, you said your head was dizzy earlier... Do you think it was because of the runes?"
    e "弗坎，你之前说你的头很晕……你觉得那是符文造成的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_6707960b:

    # f "It is possible. The runes hold a lot of power, and they are capable of affecting the mind in ways we cannot comprehend."
    f "有这个可能。符文蕴含着巨大的力量，能够以我们无法理解的方式影响心智。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_After_Temple_13beed96:

    # f "I am not certain of the cultists' plan, but I am sure it was no benevolent intent."
    f "我不确定那些邪教徒的计划，但我敢肯定，他们绝非出于善意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_After_Temple_da9a0bf5:

    # e "Kari... do you know anything about the cultists?"
    e "卡里……你知道那些邪教徒的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_After_Temple_4cd0c330:

    # k "All I know is you took our chief into some temple and risked his life for it."
    k "我只知道，你带我们的酋长进了某座神殿，还让他为此冒了生命危险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_After_Temple_bab5ee91:

    # e "I... I didn't mean to put him in danger. We didn't know there were others in the temple."
    e "我……我不是故意要让他陷入危险。我们不知道神殿里还有其他人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_After_Temple_07aad362:

    # k "Fuck you, [e]. Furkan is our chief... what if something happened to him. We can't-..."
    k "操你，[e]。弗坎是我们的酋长……万一他出了什么事。我们不能——……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_After_Temple_50c21cde:

    # k "This is a huge mistake, the alliance and all. If not for you meddling the water, this wouldn't have all happened."
    k "这一切都是个天大的错误，联盟什么的。要不是你插手水源，也不会发生这一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_After_Temple_a19f0aed:

    # e "I'm sorry, Kari. I truly am."
    e "对不起，卡里。我真的很抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_After_Temple_c279f1e9:

    # k "You are not. You say this but you keep doing it over and over again. You'd always run headfirst into danger, then expect everyone to bail you out."
    k "你才没有。你嘴上这么说，却一次又一次地做着同样的事。你总是莽莽撞撞地冲进危险里，然后指望所有人来替你收拾烂摊子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_After_Temple_77d5bb0d:

    # k "You've never changed, even after being the chief it didn't stave you off being a reckless kid, you just stopped asking for forgiveness."
    k "你从没变过。就算当上了酋长，也没能让你不再是个莽撞的孩子；你只是停止了请求原谅。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_After_Temple_33054f6b:

    # e "I... being the chief?"
    e "我……当酋长？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_After_Temple_ae21f0a0:

    # "Kari's eyes suddenly widens as he turns to you."
    "卡里转向你时，双眼突然睁大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_After_Temple_48455963:

    # k "No, I misspoke."
    k "不，我说错了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_After_Temple_43c0ff83:

    # k "What else were you going to say?"
    k "你还想说什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_About_Festival_5dc8bdd1:

    # e "Furkan, what's the festival that your tribe celebrates?"
    e "弗坎，你们部落庆祝的那个节日是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_About_Festival_fbf23a67:

    # f "The festival? It has not been held for years... how do you know about it?"
    f "那个节日？已经好几年没办过了……你是怎么知道的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_About_Festival_3af1a29b:

    # e "Uh... I've heard from a goat."
    e "呃……我听一只山羊说的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_About_Festival_0c0c7442:

    # f "I see. Well, we celebrate the festival of flowing water here, it's a tradition that has been passed down since the beginning of our tribe."
    f "我明白了。我们这里庆祝的是流水节，这是自部落建立之初就流传下来的传统。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_About_Festival_73300865:

    # f "It is held every year, on the first full moon of spring. The chief will grant everyone in our tribe a blessing for the year to come."
    f "这个节日每年都会举办，在春季的第一个满月之夜。酋长会为部落里的每个人赐予来年的祝福。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_About_Festival_e75d8680:

    # f "There would be merchants and visitors coming from far and wide, stalls lined around the tribe, and we would have a feast to celebrate the occasion."
    f "届时，各地都会有商人和游客前来，部落四周摆满摊位，我们还会举办宴席庆祝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_About_Festival_0f2c1e4a:

    # f "We had stopped holding the festival lately. The flowing water had become scarce ever since the primordial runes were stolen..."
    f "我们最近已经不再举办这个节日了。自从原初符文被盗之后，流水就变得越来越稀少……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_About_Festival_b2195aec:

    # e "Hmm, I'd like to see it one day."
    e "嗯……我希望有一天能亲眼看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_About_Festival_b84658c5:

    # f "If the water flows once more, I would be happy to show you."
    f "如果水流能再次恢复，我很乐意带你去看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Ask_About_Festival_a15a5990:

    # "Furkan smiles."
    "弗坎微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_8cb9a88a:

    # e "Hey, Kari. I've heard about some festival here... Do you know anything about it?"
    e "嘿，卡里。我听说这里有个节日……你知道些什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_c4a6d3c2:

    # k "What? Where did you stick your nosy snout into this time?"
    k "什么？你这爱管闲事的鼻子，这次又伸到哪儿去了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_17d2d911:

    # e "Uh... Somewhere?"
    e "呃……某个地方？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_c6bc7423:

    # k "Hmph... whatever, I don't care who you couriers listen to. What else do you want to know?"
    k "哼……随便吧，我才不在乎你们这些信使听谁的。你还想知道什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_3593abf5:

    # e "Maybe how was the festival like for you?"
    e "或许可以问问，对你来说，那个节日是什么样的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_b6a1eb40:

    # k "It was... fine, I guess. I don't like the crowds, so I usually stood by the ceremony sometimes."
    k "还行吧……我想是这样。我不喜欢人多，所以有时候会待在仪式旁边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_741ff754:

    # k "Hmm... I guess I did miss the cabbage rolls and stuff, that was nice."
    k "嗯……我想我确实挺想念卷心菜卷之类的，那东西挺不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_c6edd0b5:

    # e "Cabbage rolls?"
    e "卷心菜卷？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_4676686c:

    # k "Yeah? Do I have to explain to you what a cabbage is as well?"
    k "怎么？还要我顺便给你解释一下什么是卷心菜吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_0cc8e5f2:

    # e "N-no, I just-"
    e "不、不是，我只是——"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_6a126bc5:

    # k "It's a vegetable, [e]. You wrap some cheese and rice in it. Is it that hard to understand?"
    k "那是一种蔬菜，[e]。把奶酪和米饭包在里面。有那么难理解吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_faa18131:

    # k "Sorry, I didn't mean to snap. The rolls were good."
    k "抱歉，我不是有意冲你发火的。那些卷菜挺好吃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_bdca137e:

    # e "It's okay. I guess at least I learnt something new about you."
    e "没事。我想，至少我又了解了你一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kari_Ask_About_Festival_c5f6c6f7:

    # k "Yeah, well. Don't get used to it."
    k "行吧。你可别习惯了。"
